  ('NXSB16AFD', 'Wylex AFDD RCBO 16A Type A Single Pole 6kA NXSB16AFD', 'wylex-afdd-rcbo-16a-type-a-single-pole-6ka-nxsb16afd', 'Wylex NXSB16AFD 16A Combined AFDD/RCBO. Packed within a single module construction NXSB16AFD provides protection from arc fault detection device, offers additional 18th Edition protection against electrical fires that cannot be offered by MCBs, RCDs and RCBO’s. AFDDs will detect and disconnect dangerous electrical arcing faults, reducing the risk of fires from occurring in domestic properties. Packed within a single module NXSB16AFD provides the protection capability of an RCBO, detecting earth fault currents, overload and short circuit currents whilst incorporating the capabilities of an AFDD, protecting against arc faults, overheating and insulation faults in wiring systems through continuous continuously monitoring the circuit for a variety of conditions, including the duration of the arc, irregularity and the waveform. When a fault is detected the device shuts down the supply prev…', 'Wylex', '{"Caractéristique 1":"1P+N arc fault detection device (AFDD)","Rating":"16 Amp","Trip current":"30mA","Caractéristique 2":"Single Module","Caractéristique 3":"Easy installation","Caractéristique 4":"Combined 30mA miniature RCBO/AFDD","Type":"B curve","Caractéristique 5":"Breaking capacity 6kA","Caractéristique 6":"DIN rail mounted","Terminal capacity":"0.75mm² – 16mm²","Number of poles":"Single pole and neutral","Number of modules":"1","Voltage":"230V","Height":"90mm","Width":"18mm","Depth":"77mm","Standards":"BS EN 62606 & IEC 61009-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/wylex-nxsb16afd-16a-combined-rcbo-afdd-type-b.webp', 'detecteurs-arc-afdd'),
  ('NXSB10AFD', 'Wylex AFDD RCBO 10A Type A Single Pole 6kA NXSB10AFD', 'wylex-afdd-rcbo-10a-type-a-single-pole-6ka-nxsb10afd', 'Wylex NXSB10AFD 10A Combined AFDD/RCBO. Packed within a single module construction NXSB10AFD provides protection from arc fault detection device, offers additional 18th Edition protection against electrical fires that cannot be offered by MCBs, RCDs and RCBO’s. AFDDs will detect and disconnect dangerous electrical arcing faults, reducing the risk of fires from occurring in domestic properties. Packed within a single module NXSB10AFD provides the protection capability of an RCBO, detecting earth fault currents, overload and short circuit currents whilst incorporating the capabilities of an AFDD, protecting against arc faults, overheating and insulation faults in wiring systems through continuous continuously monitoring the circuit for a variety of conditions, including the duration of the arc, irregularity and the waveform. When a fault is detected the device shuts down the supply prev…', 'Wylex', '{"Caractéristique 1":"1P+N arc fault detection device (AFDD)","Rating":"10 Amp","Trip current":"30mA","Caractéristique 2":"Single Module","Caractéristique 3":"Easy installation","Caractéristique 4":"Combined 30mA miniature RCBO/AFDD","Type":"B curve","Caractéristique 5":"Breaking capacity 6kA","Caractéristique 6":"DIN rail mounted","Terminal capacity":"0.75mm² – 16mm²","Number of poles":"Single pole and neutral","Number of modules":"1","Voltage":"230V","Height":"90mm","Width":"18mm","Depth":"77mm","Standards":"BS EN 62606 & IEC 61009-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/wylex-b-curve-type-a-afdd-switched-neutral-10a.webp', 'detecteurs-arc-afdd'),
  ('NXSB06AFD', 'Wylex AFDD RCBO 6A Type A Single Pole 6kA NXSB06AFD', 'wylex-afdd-rcbo-6a-type-a-single-pole-6ka-nxsb06afd', 'Wylex NXSB06AFD 6A Combined AFDD/RCBO. Packed within a single module construction NXSB06AFD provides protection from arc fault detection device, offers additional 18th Edition protection against electrical fires that cannot be offered by MCBs, RCDs and RCBO’s. AFDDs will detect and disconnect dangerous electrical arcing faults, reducing the risk of fires from occurring in domestic properties. Packed within a single module NXSB06AFD provides the protection capability of an RCBO, detecting earth fault currents, overload and short circuit currents whilst incorporating the capabilities of an AFDD, protecting against arc faults, overheating and insulation faults in wiring systems through continuous continuously monitoring the circuit for a variety of conditions, including the duration of the arc, irregularity and the waveform. When a fault is detected the device shuts down the supply preve…', 'Wylex', '{"Caractéristique 1":"1P+N arc fault detection device (AFDD)","Rating":"6 Amp","Trip current":"30mA","Caractéristique 2":"Single Module","Caractéristique 3":"Easy installation","Caractéristique 4":"Combined 30mA miniature RCBO/AFDD","Type":"B curve","Caractéristique 5":"Breaking capacity 6kA","Caractéristique 6":"DIN rail mounted","Terminal capacity":"0.75mm² – 16mm²","Number of poles":"Single pole and neutral","Number of modules":"1","Voltage":"230V","Height":"90mm","Width":"18mm","Depth":"77mm","Standards":"BS EN 62606 & IEC 61009-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/wylex-nxsb06afd-6a-combined-rcbo-afdd-type-b.webp', 'detecteurs-arc-afdd'),
  ('AGSRW5', 'FuseBox AGSRW5 Reinforced Grommet Strip White (5m)', 'fusebox-agsrw5-reinforced-grommet-strip-white-5m', 'Elevate your cable management game with the FuseBox AGSRW5 Reinforced Grommet Strip (5m). This innovative solution isn’t just another strip; it’s your ticket to a clutter-free and organized workspace. Say goodbye to tangles and chaos as the AGSRW5 streamlines your cables effortlessly. With 5 meters of flexible, reinforced grommet strip at your disposal, you’ll have the freedom to design a neat, clean, and professional look for your home or office. No more tripping hazards or unsightly wires ruining your aesthetics. Not only does the AGSRW5 enhance the appearance of your space, but it also safeguards your cables from wear and tear. You’ll enjoy the peace of mind that comes with durable cable protection. No more frayed or damaged cords disrupting your connectivity. Quick and easy installation means you can achieve your cable management goals in no time. No need for complicated setups or…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"5 meters of flexible, reinforced grommet strip","Caractéristique 2":"Easy DIY installation","Caractéristique 3":"Durable cable protection","Caractéristique 4":"Aesthetic cable management solution","Caractéristique 5":"Endless customization options"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/AGSRW5.png', 'accessoires-raccordement'),
  ('DRISO633P', 'Fusebox DRISO633P 63A 3 Pole DIN Rail Isolator Switch AC-23A', 'fusebox-driso633p-63a-3-pole-din-rail-isolator-switch-ac-23a', 'The Fusebox DRISO633P is a robust 63A 3 Pole DIN Rail Isolator Switch designed for AC-23A applications. This professional-grade switching solution mounts directly onto standard DIN rail, making it ideal for electrical distribution boards and control panels where reliable isolation is essential. With a 63A current rating and three-pole configuration, it provides comprehensive circuit isolation across multiple phases. The compact DIN rail mounting ensures space-efficient installation in confined panel environments, whilst maintaining full operational safety and performance standards. Backed by a 1-year guarantee, this isolator switch delivers dependable service for industrial and commercial electrical installations requiring certified isolation capabilities.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"DIN Rail Isolator Switch"}'::jsonb, null, 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('DRISO323P', 'Fusebox DRISO323P 32A 3 Pole DIN Rail Isolator Switch AC-23A', 'fusebox-driso323p-32a-3-pole-din-rail-isolator-switch-ac-23a', 'The Fusebox DRISO323P is a robust 32A 3 Pole DIN Rail Isolator Switch designed for AC-23A applications. This professional-grade switching solution mounts directly onto standard DIN rail, making it ideal for electrical distribution boards and control panels where reliable isolation is essential. With a 32A current rating and three-pole configuration, it provides comprehensive circuit isolation across multiple phases. The compact DIN rail mounting ensures space-efficient installation in confined panel environments, whilst maintaining full operational safety and performance standards. Backed by a 1-year guarantee, this isolator switch delivers dependable service for industrial and commercial electrical installations requiring certified isolation capabilities.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"DIN Rail Isolator Switch"}'::jsonb, null, 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('INC634NC', 'FuseBox INC634NC 63A 230V N/C 4 pole Contactor', 'fusebox-inc634nc-63a-230v-n-c-4-pole-contactor', 'The FuseBox INC634NC is a robust 4-pole contactor designed for reliable switching and control in industrial and commercial electrical applications. Rated at 63A (AC-7a) or 20A (AC-7b), this normally closed contactor delivers consistent performance with minimal power consumption—just 2.1W dissipated wattage and 6.5VA holding requirement. Built for durability, it accommodates cable sizes up to 16mm² and includes two 9mm heat dissipation spacers for optimal thermal management. The low inrush demand of 53VA ensures smooth operation without excessive electrical stress on your system. Engineered to FuseBox standards, this modular contactor integrates seamlessly into DIN rail installations and is backed by a 1-year warranty. Ideal for motor control, lighting circuits, and automated switching applications where reliability and efficiency matter.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Rated at 63A (AC-7a) or 20A (AC-7b)","Holding VA":"6.5VA","Inrush VA":"53VA","Dissipated wattage":"2.1W","Maximum cable capacity":"16mm2","Caractéristique 2":"4 Pole","Caractéristique 3":"Supplied with 2x9mm heat dissipation spacers","Caractéristique 4":"Normally Closed state configuration","Caractéristique 5":"1 Year Warranty"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/INC634.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('INC404NC', 'FuseBox INC404NC 40A 230V N/C 4 pole Contactor', 'fusebox-inc404nc-40a-230v-n-c-4-pole-contactor', 'The FuseBox INC404NC is a robust 40A 230V normally closed 4 pole contactor designed for reliable switching and load control in electrical installations. Rated at 40A (AC-7a) or 8.5A (AC-7b), this modular contactor delivers consistent performance with minimal power consumption—just 1.6W dissipated wattage and 4.6VA holding requirement. Built for efficiency, the unit features low inrush demand at 34VA and accommodates cable sizes up to 16mm². The package includes two 9mm heat dissipation spacers to optimise thermal management and extend operational life. Its normally closed configuration makes it ideal for safety-critical applications requiring fail-safe operation. Engineered to professional standards, the INC404NC combines compact modular design with dependable switching capability, backed by a 1 year warranty for peace of mind.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Rated at 40A (AC-7a) or 8.5A (AC-7b)","Holding VA":"4.6VA","Inrush VA":"34VA","Dissipated wattage":"1.6W","Maximum cable capacity":"16mm2","Caractéristique 2":"2 Pole","Caractéristique 3":"Supplied with 2x9mm heat dissipation spacers","Caractéristique 4":"Normally Closed state configuration","Caractéristique 5":"1 Year Warranty"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/INC254-1.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('INC254NC', 'FuseBox INC254NC 25A 230V N/C 4 pole Contactor', 'fusebox-inc254nc-25a-230v-n-c-4-pole-contactor', 'FuseBox INC254NC 25A 230V N/C 4 Pole Contactor The FuseBox INC254NC is a robust modular contactor designed for reliable switching and control in industrial and commercial electrical applications. Rated at 25A (AC-7a) or 15A (AC-7b), this 4-pole unit delivers consistent performance with minimal power consumption. Key specifications include a holding power of just 4.6VA and inrush of 34VA, making it energy-efficient for continuous operation. With a dissipated wattage of 1.6W and maximum cable capacity of 16mm², it accommodates standard installation requirements. The normally closed configuration provides fail-safe operation, whilst the supplied 9mm heat dissipation spacers ensure optimal thermal management. Built to professional standards, this contactor features a 1-year warranty and is ideal for motor control, lighting circuits, and load switching applications where reliability is ess…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Rated at 25A (AC-7a) or 15A (AC-7b)","Holding VA":"4.6VA","Inrush VA":"34VA","Dissipated wattage":"1.6W","Maximum cable capacity":"16mm2","Caractéristique 2":"4 Pole","Caractéristique 3":"Supplied with 2x9mm heat dissipation spacers","Caractéristique 4":"Normally Closed state configuration","Caractéristique 5":"1 Year Warranty"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/INC254.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('INC632NC', 'FuseBox INC632NC 63A 230V N/C 2 pole Contactor', 'fusebox-inc632nc-63a-230v-n-c-2-pole-contactor', 'The FuseBox INC632NC is a robust 2 pole contactor designed for reliable switching and control in electrical installations. Rated at 63A (AC-7a) or 20A (AC-7b), this normally closed contactor delivers efficient performance with minimal power consumption—just 2.1W dissipated wattage and 6.5VA holding requirement. Built for durability, it accommodates cable sizes up to 16mm² and includes two 9mm heat dissipation spacers for optimal thermal management. The low inrush demand of 53VA ensures smooth operation without excessive electrical stress on your system. Ideal for industrial and commercial applications requiring dependable load switching, this contactor combines compact modular design with professional-grade specifications. Backed by a 1 year warranty, it represents a cost-effective solution for modern electrical control systems.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"63A (AC-7a) or 20A (AC-7b)","Holding VA":"6.5VA","Inrush VA":"53VA","Dissipated wattage":"2.1W","Maximum cable capacity":"16mm²","Caractéristique 2":"2 pole","Caractéristique 3":"Supplied with 2x 9mm heat dissipation spacers","Caractéristique 4":"Normally Closed state configuration","Caractéristique 5":"1 year warranty"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/INC632NC.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('INC402NC', 'FuseBox INC402NC 40A 230V N/C 2 pole Contactor', 'fusebox-inc402nc-40a-230v-n-c-2-pole-contactor', 'The FuseBox INC402NC is a robust 40A 230V normally closed 2 pole contactor designed for reliable switching and load control in electrical installations. Rated at 40A (AC-7a) or 8.5A (AC-7b), this modular contactor delivers consistent performance with minimal power consumption—just 1.6W dissipated wattage and 4.6VA holding requirement. Built for efficiency, the unit features low inrush demand at 34VA and accommodates cable sizes up to 4mm². The package includes two 9mm heat dissipation spacers to optimise thermal management and extend operational life. Its normally closed configuration makes it ideal for safety-critical applications requiring fail-safe operation. Engineered to professional standards, the INC402NC combines compact modular design with dependable switching capability, backed by a 1 year warranty for peace of mind.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Rated at 40A (AC-7a) or 8.5A (AC-7b)","Holding VA":"4.6VA","Inrush VA":"34VA","Dissipated wattage":"1.6W","Maximum cable capacity":"4mm2","Caractéristique 2":"2 Pole","Caractéristique 3":"Supplied with 2x9mm heat dissipation spacers","Caractéristique 4":"Normally Closed state configuration","Caractéristique 5":"1 Year Warranty"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/INC402NC.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('INC202NC', 'FuseBox INC202NC 20A 230V N/C 2 pole Contactor', 'fusebox-inc202nc-20a-230v-n-c-2-pole-contactor', 'The FuseBox INC202NC is a robust 20A 230V modular contactor designed for reliable switching and load control in industrial and commercial applications. This 2-pole normally closed contactor delivers consistent performance with a rated capacity of 20A (AC-7a) or 6.4A (AC-7b), making it suitable for a wide range of electrical circuits. Built for efficiency, the unit features minimal power consumption with holding VA of 2.7VA and inrush VA of 9.2VA, whilst dissipating just 1.2W during operation. The contactor accommodates cable sizes up to 4mm² and comes supplied with two 9mm heat dissipation spacers to optimise thermal management and extend operational life. Engineered to exacting standards, this FuseBox contactor offers dependable switching action and is backed by a 1-year warranty. Ideal for automation systems, motor control, and load management applications where precision and durabi…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Rated at 20A (AC-7a) or 6.4A (AC-7b)","Holding VA":"2.7VA","Inrush VA":"9.2VA","Dissipated wattage":"1.2W","Maximum cable capacity":"4mm2","Caractéristique 2":"2 Pole","Caractéristique 3":"Supplied with 2x9mm heat dissipation spacers","Caractéristique 4":"Normally Closed state configuration","Caractéristique 5":"1 Year Warranty"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/Screenshot-2026-07-08-135055.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('IT1002DS', 'FuseBox IT1002DS 100A Double Pole Main Switch with Dual Screw Terminals', 'fusebox-it1002ds-100a-double-pole-main-switch-with-dual-screw-terminals', 'The FuseBox IT1002DS is a robust 100A double pole main switch engineered for reliable power distribution and circuit protection in residential and commercial installations. Featuring dual screw terminals, this switch delivers a secure electrical connection that meets professional standards whilst ensuring straightforward installation and maintenance. Designed with a double pole configuration, the IT1002DS simultaneously interrupts both live and neutral conductors, providing comprehensive protection for your electrical system and connected appliances. The modern construction combines durability with a clean aesthetic that integrates seamlessly into any electrical enclosure. Installation is straightforward, allowing for quick replacement of existing switches without complications. The robust build quality and proven FuseBox engineering ensure long-term reliability and consistent perform…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Double pole design for enhanced power interruption.","Caractéristique 2":"Advanced technology for comprehensive protection.","Caractéristique 3":"User-friendly installation and operation.","Caractéristique 4":"Sleek and modern construction.","Caractéristique 5":"Swift and decisive power interruption for optimized energy management.","Caractéristique 6":"Unparalleled protection for your appliances and electronics.","Caractéristique 7":"Easy installation, seamlessly replacing old switches.","Caractéristique 8":"Dual screw terminals provide a higher security electrical connection","Caractéristique 9":"Sleek design that complements your space."}'::jsonb, '/images/products/IT1002DS.png', 'interrupteurs-protection-generale'),
  ('RTAM100B40BD', 'FuseBox RTAM100B40BD 40 Amp Bidirectional Mini RCBO B Curve Type A SPN 100mA 6kA', 'fusebox-rtam100b40bd-40-amp-bidirectional-mini-rcbo-b-curve-type-a-spn-100ma-6ka', 'Designed for use in FuseBox consumer units, the RTAM100B40BD is a compact 40A B Curve 100mA Bi-directional RCBO featuring Double Pole switching, which controls both Live and Neutral.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"40A 6kA 100mA B Curve","Caractéristique 2":"Bi-Directional","Caractéristique 3":"Double Pole RCBO 1P+N (switched)","Caractéristique 4":"Type A for AC and pulsating DC sensitivity","Caractéristique 5":"Single module Mini RCBO","Caractéristique 6":"Retrofit to any FuseBox Consumer Unit","Caractéristique 7":"Fully compliant and 3rd party tested to BS EN 62606 / IEC 61009-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/FuseBox-RTAM100B16BD-100mA-Curve-B-Type-A-Bi-Directional-Mini-RCBO-16A.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('RTAM100B32BD', 'FuseBox RTAM100B32BD 32 Amp Bidirectional Mini RCBO B Curve Type A SPN 100mA 6kA', 'fusebox-rtam100b32bd-32-amp-bidirectional-mini-rcbo-b-curve-type-a-spn-100ma-6ka', 'Designed for use in FuseBox consumer units, the RTAM100B32BD is a compact 32A B Curve 100mA Bi-directional RCBO featuring Double Pole switching, which controls both Live and Neutral.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"32A 6kA 100mA B Curve","Caractéristique 2":"Bi-Directional","Caractéristique 3":"Double Pole RCBO 1P+N (switched)","Caractéristique 4":"Type A for AC and pulsating DC sensitivity","Caractéristique 5":"Single module Mini RCBO","Caractéristique 6":"Retrofit to any FuseBox Consumer Unit","Caractéristique 7":"Fully compliant and 3rd party tested to BS EN 62606 / IEC 61009-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/FuseBox-RTAM100B16BD-100mA-Curve-B-Type-A-Bi-Directional-Mini-RCBO-16A.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('RTAM100B25BD', 'FuseBox RTAM100B25BD 25 Amp Bidirectional Mini RCBO B Curve Type A SPN 100mA 6kA', 'fusebox-rtam100b25bd-25-amp-bidirectional-mini-rcbo-b-curve-type-a-spn-100ma-6ka', 'Designed for use in FuseBox consumer units, the RTAM100B25BD is a compact 25A B Curve 100mA Bi-directional RCBO featuring Double Pole switching, which controls both Live and Neutral.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"25A 6kA 100mA B Curve","Caractéristique 2":"Bi-Directional","Caractéristique 3":"Double Pole RCBO 1P+N (switched)","Caractéristique 4":"Type A for AC and pulsating DC sensitivity","Caractéristique 5":"Single module Mini RCBO","Caractéristique 6":"Retrofit to any FuseBox Consumer Unit","Caractéristique 7":"Fully compliant and 3rd party tested to BS EN 62606 / IEC 61009-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/FuseBox-RTAM100B16BD-100mA-Curve-B-Type-A-Bi-Directional-Mini-RCBO-16A.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('RTAM100B20BD', 'FuseBox RTAM100B20BD 20 Amp Bidirectional Mini RCBO B Curve Type A SPN 100mA 6kA', 'fusebox-rtam100b20bd-20-amp-bidirectional-mini-rcbo-b-curve-type-a-spn-100ma-6ka', 'Designed for use in FuseBox consumer units, the RTAM100B20BD is a compact 20A B Curve 100mA Bi-directional RCBO featuring Double Pole switching, which controls both Live and Neutral.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"20A 6kA 100mA B Curve","Caractéristique 2":"Bi-Directional","Caractéristique 3":"Double Pole RCBO 1P+N (switched)","Caractéristique 4":"Type A for AC and pulsating DC sensitivity","Caractéristique 5":"Single module Mini RCBO","Caractéristique 6":"Retrofit to any FuseBox Consumer Unit","Caractéristique 7":"Fully compliant and 3rd party tested to BS EN 62606 / IEC 61009-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/FuseBox-RTAM100B16BD-100mA-Curve-B-Type-A-Bi-Directional-Mini-RCBO-16A.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('RTAM100B16BD', 'FuseBox RTAM100B16BD 16 Amp Bidirectional Mini RCBO B Curve Type A SPN 100mA 6kA', 'fusebox-rtam100b16bd-16-amp-bidirectional-mini-rcbo-b-curve-type-a-spn-100ma-6ka', 'Designed for use in FuseBox consumer units, the RTAM100B16BD is a compact 16A B Curve 100mA Bi-directional RCBO featuring Double Pole switching, which controls both Live and Neutral.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"16A 6kA 100mA B Curve","Caractéristique 2":"Bi-Directional","Caractéristique 3":"Double Pole RCBO 1P+N (switched)","Caractéristique 4":"Type A for AC and pulsating DC sensitivity","Caractéristique 5":"Single module Mini RCBO","Caractéristique 6":"Retrofit to any FuseBox Consumer Unit","Caractéristique 7":"Fully compliant and 3rd party tested to BS EN 62606 / IEC 61009-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/FuseBox-RTAM100B16BD-100mA-Curve-B-Type-A-Bi-Directional-Mini-RCBO-16A.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('RTA060430B', 'Fusebox RCBO RTA060430B 4Amps 30mA Type A 6kA B Curve', 'fusebox-rcbo-rta060430b-4amps-30ma-type-a-6ka-b-curve', 'The FuseBox RTA060430B RCBO SPN 4A is a high-performance single pole device designed with a B curve for precise tripping characteristics, protecting circuits from overloads and short circuits. This Type A RCBO detects AC and pulsating DC currents, providing reliable protection for 18th Edition compliant installations. It features a 6kA short circuit capacity, making it ideal for heavy-duty circuit protection. Features:', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"4A Single Pole + Neutral (SPN) configuration for circuit protection","Caractéristique 2":"B Curve tripping characteristics for accurate response to overloads and short circuits","Caractéristique 3":"6kA breaking capacity ensures robust short circuit protection","Caractéristique 4":"Type A RCBO detects AC and pulsating DC components","Caractéristique 5":"30mA residual current protection for enhanced electrical safety","Caractéristique 6":"DIN rail mountable for easy installation in consumer units","Caractéristique 7":"Compliant with BS EN 61009-1, ensuring adherence to the highest safety standards","Caractéristique 8":"Mechanical endurance of up to 10,000 cycles","Caractéristique 9":"Neutral fly cable length of 450mm for flexibility during installation","Caractéristique 10":"IP20 protection rating for indoor use"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/RTA0630mATypeA6kABType.png', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('RTA060230B', 'Fusebox RCBO RTA060230B 2Amps 30mA Type A 6kA B Curve', 'fusebox-rcbo-rta060230b-2amps-30ma-type-a-6ka-b-curve', 'The FuseBox RTA060230B RCBO SPN 2A is a high-performance single pole device designed with a B curve for precise tripping characteristics, protecting circuits from overloads and short circuits. This Type A RCBO detects AC and pulsating DC currents, providing reliable protection for 18th Edition compliant installations. It features a 6kA short circuit capacity, making it ideal for heavy-duty circuit protection. Features:', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"2A Single Pole + Neutral (SPN) configuration for circuit protection","Caractéristique 2":"B Curve tripping characteristics for accurate response to overloads and short circuits","Caractéristique 3":"6kA breaking capacity ensures robust short circuit protection","Caractéristique 4":"Type A RCBO detects AC and pulsating DC components","Caractéristique 5":"30mA residual current protection for enhanced electrical safety","Caractéristique 6":"DIN rail mountable for easy installation in consumer units","Caractéristique 7":"Compliant with BS EN 61009-1, ensuring adherence to the highest safety standards","Caractéristique 8":"Mechanical endurance of up to 10,000 cycles","Caractéristique 9":"Neutral fly cable length of 450mm for flexibility during installation","Caractéristique 10":"IP20 protection rating for indoor use"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/RTA0630mATypeA6kABType.png', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('MT06B041', 'Fusebox MT06B041 – SP MCB B Type 4Amp', 'fusebox-mt06b041-sp-mcb-b-type-4amp', 'FuseBox offer a wide range of metal consumer units and protection devices, which are reliable and affordable. Based in the UK, FuseBox offer flexible and versatile solutions for 18th Edition electrical installations. The FuseBox MT06B is a single pole, MCB with a B curve and 6kA short circuit capacity. Terminal capacity: 16mm² Standard: BS EN 60898-1', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"18th Edition compliant","Caractéristique 2":"6amp, 10amp, 16amp, 20amp, 32amp, 40amp, 50amp and 63amp","Caractéristique 3":"Type B","Caractéristique 4":"B curve","Caractéristique 5":"6kA","Caractéristique 6":"Single Pole","Caractéristique 7":"MCB","Caractéristique 8":"BS EN 60898-1","Product code":"MT06B"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/Screenshot20250609092529.png', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
  ('MT06B021', 'Fusebox MT06B021 – SP MCB B Type 2Amp', 'fusebox-mt06b061-sp-mcb-b-type-2amp', 'FuseBox offer a wide range of metal consumer units and protection devices, which are reliable and affordable. Based in the UK, FuseBox offer flexible and versatile solutions for 18th Edition electrical installations. The FuseBox MT06B is a single pole, MCB with a B curve and 6kA short circuit capacity. Terminal capacity: 16mm² Standard: BS EN 60898-1', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"18th Edition compliant","Caractéristique 2":"6amp, 10amp, 16amp, 20amp, 32amp, 40amp, 50amp and 63amp","Caractéristique 3":"Type B","Caractéristique 4":"B curve","Caractéristique 5":"6kA","Caractéristique 6":"Single Pole","Caractéristique 7":"MCB","Caractéristique 8":"BS EN 60898-1","Product code":"MT06B"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/Screenshot20250609092529.png', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
  ('P65E8M', 'FuseBox P65E8M 8 Module IP65 ABS Enclosure', 'fusebox-p65e8m-8-module-ip65-abs-enclosure', 'The FuseBox P65E8M is a robust 8-module IP65 ABS enclosure designed for reliable electrical distribution in demanding environments. This empty enclosure provides 8 useable ways with shrouded Earth and Neutral terminals for enhanced safety and organisation. Built to withstand harsh conditions, it features IK07 impact protection and maintains a full IP65 rating with its drop-down lid and security wire tag sealing capability. Multiple cable entry drill-outs positioned on the top, bottom, sides, and rear offer flexible installation options for various applications. The unit comes supplied with neutral cable and busbar, reducing installation time and ensuring proper earthing. Ideal for industrial, commercial, and outdoor installations where durability and weather resistance are essential, this enclosure delivers professional-grade performance and longevity.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"8 useable ways","Caractéristique 2":"Shrouded Earth & Neutral Terminals","Caractéristique 3":"Cable Entry Drill-outs on top, bottom, sides and rear","Caractéristique 4":"IP65 and IK07 Rated","Caractéristique 5":"Supplied with neutral cable and busbar","Caractéristique 6":"Can be sealed with wire tag for security and drop-down lid to ensure IP65 rating"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/P65E8M.png', 'coffrets-enveloppes'),
  ('P65GRAZ', 'FuseBox P65GRAZ IP65 ABS Garage Consumer Unit with T2 SPD Grey', 'fusebox-p65graz-ip65-abs-garage-consumer-unit-with-t2-spd-grey', 'The FuseBox P65GRAZ is a robust IP65-rated consumer unit designed for garage and outdoor applications where weather protection is essential. Built from durable ABS plastic with IK07 impact resistance, this unit delivers reliable electrical distribution in demanding environments. Featuring a 63A 30mA RCD as the main incoming device, it provides comprehensive fault protection for your installation. The integrated Type 2 SPD (Surge Protection Device) connected directly to the busbar safeguards connected equipment from transient overvoltages. Modular 6A and 16A MCBs allow flexible circuit configuration to suit your specific requirements. The removable and raised DIN rail simplifies installation and maintenance, while shrouded Earth and Neutral terminals ensure safe, organised wiring. Multiple cable entry points on the top, bottom, sides, and rear provide installation flexibility. The drop…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"63A 30MA RCD & 6A/16A MCBS","Caractéristique 2":"Direct to busbar Type 2 SPD","Caractéristique 3":"Shrouded Earth & Neutral Terminals","Caractéristique 4":"Removable and raised DIN rail","Caractéristique 5":"ABS Plastic Construction","Caractéristique 6":"IP65 and IK07 Rated","Caractéristique 7":"Cable Entry Drill-outs on top, bottom, sides and rear","Caractéristique 8":"Can be sealed with wire tag for security and drop-down lid to ensure IP65 rating"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/FuseBox-ABS-5-Module-4.jpg', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('P65GRA', 'FuseBox P65GRA IP65 ABS Garage Consumer Unit Grey', 'fusebox-p65gra-ip65-abs-garage-consumer-unit-grey', 'The FuseBox P65GRA is a robust IP65-rated consumer unit designed for garage and outdoor applications where protection from dust and water ingress is essential. Built from durable ABS plastic, this unit combines reliable electrical protection with practical durability. Featuring a 63A 30mA RCD and 6A/16A MCBs, it delivers comprehensive circuit protection for your installation. The IK07 impact rating ensures resilience in demanding environments, while the pad-lockable front cover provides security and tamper prevention. Installation flexibility is built in with 20mm drill-outs on all sides (top, bottom, sides, and rear), expandable to 32mm to accommodate various cable entry requirements. Shrouded earth and neutral terminals enhance safety during maintenance and operation. Compact dimensions of 223mm x 165mm x 100mm make it ideal for space-constrained garage installations. Backed by a 1-…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"63A 30MA RCD & 6A/16A MCBS","Caractéristique 2":"IP65 and IK07 Rated","Caractéristique 3":"20mm Drill-outs on top, bottom, sides, and rear – expandable to 32mm","Caractéristique 4":"Pad-lockable Front Cover","Caractéristique 5":"Shrouded Earth & Neutral Terminals","Caractéristique 6":"ABS Plastic Construction"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/FuseBox-ABS-5-Module-4.jpg', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('P65E5M', 'FuseBox P65E5M 5 Module IP65 ABS Enclosure', 'fusebox-p65e5m-5-module-ip65-abs-enclosure', 'The FuseBox P65E5M is a robust 5-module IP65 ABS enclosure designed for reliable electrical distribution in demanding environments. Built to withstand harsh conditions, this empty enclosure features shrouded Earth and Neutral terminals for enhanced safety, along with flexible cable entry drill-outs positioned on the top, bottom, sides, and rear for versatile installation options. With IK07 impact protection, the enclosure delivers durability against physical damage. It comes complete with neutral cable and busbar, streamlining setup and reducing additional procurement. The drop-down lid and wire tag sealing capability maintain the IP65 rating, ensuring protection against dust and water ingress in outdoor and wet locations. Ideal for electrical contractors and distributors seeking a dependable, modular solution for circuit protection and distribution applications.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"5 useable ways","Caractéristique 2":"Shrouded Earth & Neutral Terminals","Caractéristique 3":"Cable Entry Drill-outs on top, bottom, sides and rear","Caractéristique 4":"IP65 and IK07 Rated","Caractéristique 5":"Supplied with neutral cable and busbar","Caractéristique 6":"Can be sealed with wire tag for security and drop-down lid to ensure IP65 rating"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/shopping.webp', 'coffrets-enveloppes'),
  ('P65EV40BDZ', 'FuseBox P65EV40BDZ IP65 ABS EV Charger Supply Unit with 100A Main Switch, 40A Bi-Directional RCBO and T2 SPD', 'fusebox-p65ev40bdz-ip65-abs-ev-charger-supply-unit-with-100a-main-switch-40a-bi-directional-rcbo-and-t2-spd', 'The FuseBox P65EV40BDZ is a robust IP65-rated EV charger supply unit engineered for reliable electric vehicle charging installations. Built with durable ABS plastic construction, this unit combines essential safety and control features in a compact, weather-resistant enclosure. Key specifications include a 100A main switch for circuit isolation, a 40A bi-directional RCBO with 30mA residual current protection, and a Type 2 surge protection device connected directly to the busbar. The IP65 and IK07 ratings ensure protection against dust and water ingress, making it suitable for both indoor and outdoor environments. The unit features flexible installation options with 20mm drill-outs on all sides (expandable to 32mm), shrouded earth and neutral terminals for enhanced safety, and a pad-lockable front cover for security. Measuring 223mm x 165mm x 100mm, it delivers professional-grade prote…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"100A Main Switch","Caractéristique 2":"40A 30mA 1P+N Bi-Directional RCBO","Caractéristique 3":"Type 2 Direct to Busbar SPD","Caractéristique 4":"IP65 and IK07 Rated","Caractéristique 5":"20mm Drill-outs on top, bottom, sides, and rear – expandable to 32mm","Caractéristique 6":"Pad-lockable Front Cover","Caractéristique 7":"Shrouded Earth & Neutral Terminals","Caractéristique 8":"ABS Plastic Construction"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/P65EV32BD.png', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('P65EV32BDZ', 'FuseBox P65EV32BDZ IP65 ABS EV Charger Supply Unit with 100A Main Switch, 32A Bi-Directional RCBO and T2 SPD', 'fusebox-p65ev32bdz-ip65-abs-ev-charger-supply-unit-with-100a-main-switch-32a-bi-directional-rcbo-and-t2-spd', 'The FuseBox P65EV32BDZ is a robust IP65-rated EV charger supply unit engineered for reliable electric vehicle charging installations. Built with durable ABS plastic construction, this unit combines essential safety and control features in a compact, weather-resistant enclosure. Key specifications include a 100A main switch for circuit isolation, a 32A 30mA bi-directional RCBO for fault protection, and a Type 2 surge protection device (SPD) connected directly to the busbar. The bi-directional RCBO enables vehicle-to-grid (V2G) functionality, allowing power to flow in both directions when required. Rated to IP65 and IK07 standards, this unit withstands dust, water ingress, and impact damage, making it suitable for outdoor and demanding environments. The pad-lockable front cover provides security, while shrouded earth and neutral terminals ensure safe connections. Flexible installation i…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"100A Main Switch","Caractéristique 2":"32A 30mA 1P+N Bi-Directional RCBO","Caractéristique 3":"Type 2 Direct to Busbar SPD","Caractéristique 4":"IP65 and IK07 Rated","Caractéristique 5":"20mm Drill-outs on top, bottom, sides, and rear – expandable to 32mm","Caractéristique 6":"Pad-lockable Front Cover","Caractéristique 7":"Shrouded Earth & Neutral Terminals","Caractéristique 8":"ABS Plastic Construction"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/P65EV32BD.png', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('P65EV40BD', 'FuseBox P65EV40BD IP65 ABS EV Charger Supply Unit with 100A Main Switch and 40A Bi-Directional RCBO', 'fusebox-p65ev40bd-ip65-abs-ev-charger-supply-unit-with-100a-main-switch-and-40a-bi-directional-rcbo', 'The FuseBox P65EV40BD is a robust IP65-rated EV charger supply unit engineered for reliable electric vehicle charging installations. Featuring a 100A main switch and 40A bi-directional RCBO with 30mA residual current protection, this unit delivers comprehensive safety and control for modern EV infrastructure. Built from durable ABS plastic construction, the P65EV40BD combines weather resistance (IP65) with impact protection (IK07 rating), making it suitable for both indoor and outdoor environments. The pad-lockable front cover provides security, while shrouded earth and neutral terminals ensure safe operation. Flexible installation is enabled by 20mm drill-outs on all sides (expandable to 32mm), allowing seamless integration into various mounting configurations. The bi-directional RCBO capability supports vehicle-to-grid (V2G) applications, future-proofing your charging infrastructure…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"100A Main Switch","Caractéristique 2":"40A 30mA 1P+N Bi-Directional RCBO","Caractéristique 3":"IP65 and IK07 Rated","Caractéristique 4":"20mm Drill-outs on top, bottom, sides, and rear – expandable to 32mm","Caractéristique 5":"Pad-lockable Front Cover","Caractéristique 6":"Shrouded Earth & Neutral Terminals","Caractéristique 7":"ABS Plastic Construction"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/P65EV32BD.png', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('P65EV32BD', 'FuseBox P65EV32BD IP65 ABS EV Charger Supply Unit with 100A Main Switch and 32A Bi-Directional RCBO', 'fusebox-p65ev32bd-ip65-abs-ev-charger-supply-unit-with-100a-main-switch-and-32a-bi-directional-rcbo', 'The FuseBox P65EV32BD is a robust IP65-rated EV charger supply unit engineered for reliable electric vehicle charging infrastructure. Featuring a 100A main switch and 32A bi-directional RCBO with 30mA residual current protection, this unit delivers comprehensive safety and control for demanding charging applications. Built from durable ABS plastic construction, the P65EV32BD combines IP65 and IK07 ratings to withstand harsh environmental conditions whilst maintaining operational integrity. The pad-lockable front cover provides security, whilst shrouded earth and neutral terminals ensure safe installation and maintenance. Designed for flexibility, the unit includes 20mm drill-outs on all sides—top, bottom, sides, and rear—expandable to 32mm for seamless integration into existing electrical infrastructure. The bi-directional RCBO capability supports vehicle-to-grid (V2G) applications, f…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"100A Main Switch","Caractéristique 2":"32A 30mA 1P+N Bi-Directional RCBO","Caractéristique 3":"IP65 and IK07 Rated","Caractéristique 4":"20mm Drill-outs on top, bottom, sides, and rear – expandable to 32mm","Caractéristique 5":"Pad-lockable Front Cover","Caractéristique 6":"Shrouded Earth & Neutral Terminals","Caractéristique 7":"ABS Plastic Construction"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/P65EV32BD.png', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('RTAMB25BD', 'FuseBox RTAMB25BD 25Amp Bi-Directional RCBO B Curve 30mA 6kA TYPE A', 'fusebox-rtamb20bd-25amp-bi-directional-rcbo-b-curve-30ma-6ka-type-a', '25A, 6kA 30mA B Curve', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"25A, 6kA 30mA B Curve","Caractéristique 2":"Bi-Directional","Caractéristique 3":"Double Pole RCBO 1P+N (switched)","Caractéristique 4":"Type A for AC and pulsating DC sensitivity","Caractéristique 5":"Single module Mini RCBO","Caractéristique 6":"Retrofit to any FuseBox Consumer Unit","Caractéristique 7":"Fully compliant and 3rd party tested to BS EN 62606 / IEC 61009-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/Screenshot20250609092640.png', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('RTAMC25BD', 'FuseBox RTAMC25BD 25Amp Bi-Directional RCBO C Curve 30mA 6kA TYPE A', 'fusebox-rtamc25bd-20amp-bi-directional-rcbo-c-curve-30ma-6ka-type-a', '25A, 6kA 30mA B Curve', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"25A, 6kA 30mA B Curve","Caractéristique 2":"Bi-Directional","Caractéristique 3":"Double Pole RCBO 1P+N (switched)","Caractéristique 4":"Type A for AC and pulsating DC sensitivity","Caractéristique 5":"Single module Mini RCBO","Caractéristique 6":"Retrofit to any FuseBox Consumer Unit","Caractéristique 7":"Fully compliant and 3rd party tested to BS EN 62606 / IEC 61009-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/Screenshot20250609092640.png', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('RTA062530B', 'Fusebox RCBO RTA062530B 25Amps 30mA Type A 6kA B Curve', 'fusebox-rcbo-rta062530b-25amps-30ma-type-a-6ka-b-curve', 'The FuseBox RTA062530B RCBO SPN 25A is a high-performance single pole device designed with a B curve for precise tripping characteristics, protecting circuits from overloads and short circuits. This Type A RCBO detects AC and pulsating DC currents, providing reliable protection for 18th Edition compliant installations. It features a 6kA short circuit capacity, making it ideal for heavy-duty circuit protection. Features:', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"25A Single Pole + Neutral (SPN) configuration for circuit protection","Caractéristique 2":"B Curve tripping characteristics for accurate response to overloads and short circuits","Caractéristique 3":"6kA breaking capacity ensures robust short circuit protection","Caractéristique 4":"Type A RCBO detects AC and pulsating DC components","Caractéristique 5":"30mA residual current protection for enhanced electrical safety","Caractéristique 6":"DIN rail mountable for easy installation in consumer units","Caractéristique 7":"Compliant with BS EN 61009-1, ensuring adherence to the highest safety standards","Caractéristique 8":"Mechanical endurance of up to 10,000 cycles","Caractéristique 9":"Neutral fly cable length of 450mm for flexibility during installation","Caractéristique 10":"IP20 protection rating for indoor use"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/RTA0630mATypeA6kABType.png', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('LFE10G', 'Live LFE10G Din Rail Aerosol Fire Extinguisher Device', 'live-lfe10g-din-rail-aerosol-fire-extinguisher-device', 'The Live Electrical LFE10G DIN Rail Aerosol Fire Extinguisher is an automatic, heat-activated fire suppression device designed to protect enclosed electrical spaces where early fire detection and rapid intervention are critical. Engineered specifically for consumer units, distribution boards, control panels, and EV charger enclosures, the LFE10G activates automatically at approximately 170°C, releasing a fire-suppressing aerosol within ≤ 6 seconds. By discharging directly inside the enclosure, it helps to extinguish fires at an early stage, limit fire spread, and significantly reduce heat and smoke damage before escalation occurs. The unit is fully self-contained, requiring no external power supply, making it ideal for both new installations and retrofit applications. Its compact form factor allows installation in confined spaces, with flexible mounting via 35mm DIN rail or the suppli…', 'Live Electrical', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Automatic Heat-Activated Fire Extinguisher – No manual intervention required","Caractéristique 2":"Rapid Activation – Discharges aerosol within ≤ 6 seconds","Activation Temperature":"Approx. 170°C","Caractéristique 3":"Targeted Internal Protection – Suppresses fire directly inside the enclosure","Protected Volume":"Up to 0.4 m³","Caractéristique 4":"Self-Contained Unit – No wiring or external power needed","Caractéristique 5":"Compact Design – Ideal for consumer units and small enclosures","Caractéristique 6":"Flexible Mounting – 35mm DIN rail or adhesive mounting included","Caractéristique 7":"Standards Compliant – BS EN 15276-1 & 2 certified","Caractéristique 8":"Consumer units","Caractéristique 9":"Distribution boards","Caractéristique 10":"Electrical control panels","Caractéristique 11":"EV charger enclosures","Caractéristique 12":"Small enclosed electrical cabinets","Product Code":"LFE10G","Product Type":"Heat aerosol fire extinguishing device","Caractéristique 13":"Activation Temperature: Approx. 170°C","Spray Release Time":"≤ 6 seconds","Protected Space Volume":"≤ 0.4 m³","Extinguishing Density":"100 g/m³","Oxidiser":"Strontium Nitrate (50–58%)","Mounting Options":"35mm DIN rail or adhesive mounting","Power Supply":"Self-contained (no external power required)"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/LFE10G-IMAGE.webp', 'accessoires-raccordement'),
  ('TPNI125', 'Fusebox TPNI125 125A TP&N Metal Isolator Switch Disconnector', 'fusebox-tpni125-125a-tpn-metal-isolator-switch-disconnector', 'The Fusebox TPNI125 is a robust 125A three-pole and neutral isolator switch designed for reliable mains isolation in domestic and commercial installations. Built with a heavy-duty 1.2mm steel enclosure finished in RAL7035 grey, it delivers exceptional durability in demanding environments. The manually operated red/yellow handle provides intuitive ON/OFF control with mechanical door interlock preventing unsafe access when energised. For enhanced security, the handle accepts a padlock in the OFF position. Removable gland plates at top and bottom facilitate flexible cable entry, whilst the generous internal cavity simplifies termination work. Operating reliably between -25°C and +55°C, it integrates seamlessly with Fusebox Main Switch and TPN consumer units, making it an essential component for compliant electrical installations.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"AC-23A Rating","Caractéristique 2":"Large, durable 1.2mm steel enclosure with a powder-coated RAL7035 finish","Caractéristique 3":"Manually operated red/yellow handle for secure ON/OFF isolation","Caractéristique 4":"Mechanically interlocked door in the ‘ON’ position to prevent access","Caractéristique 5":"Handle can be padlocked in the OFF position for extra-secure isolation","Caractéristique 6":"Removable gland plates at the top and bottom","Caractéristique 7":"Spacious internal layout ensures easy cable termination","Caractéristique 8":"Operating temperature range of -25°C to +55°C","Caractéristique 9":"Compatible with Fusebox Main Switch and TPN consumer units"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/3-8-scaled.jpg', 'commande-sectionnement'),
