  ('AGU5-SR/B', 'Live AGU5-SR/B 5 Way Metal Enclosure with 40A RCBO Main Switch & SPD IP65', 'live-agu5-sr-b-5-way-metal-enclosure-with-40a-rcbo-main-switch-spd-ip65-2', 'Product Description IP65 Metal Surge Protection Electric Vehicle Charging Unit Consumer units are supplied with 100A Main Switch, 40A 30mA Type A RCBO B Curve and 20/40kA DP Surge Protective Device. Features & Benefits:', 'Live Electrical', '{"Caractéristique 1":"IP65 Surface Mounted","Caractéristique 2":"1x 100A Main Switch","Caractéristique 3":"Fitted with 40A SP B Curve Type A RCBO (AMR140B-030)","Caractéristique 4":"20/40kA DP Surge Protective Device (SA140 1P+N/1)","Caractéristique 5":"1x Plastic Blank","Caractéristique 6":"Weatherproof metal IP65 enclosure offering circuit protection for electric vehicle chargers.","Caractéristique 7":"Fully enclosed metal construction body with drop down metal cover and metal lid.","Caractéristique 8":"20&25mm diameter Circular cable entry knock-outs on the side top and bottom.","Caractéristique 9":"Modern style finished in white polyester powder coating to RAL9010.","Caractéristique 10":"Large and accessible wiring space Robust die cast construction.","Caractéristique 11":"Fully enclosed metal construction body with drop down metal cover and metal lid.","Caractéristique 12":"Complies with BS EN 61439-3, BS EN60947-3 & BS EN61643-11.","Caractéristique 13":"Raised Din rail improves cable routing.","Colour":"Black","Dimensions":"140mm (W) x 220mm (H) x 101mm (D)"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/AGU5-SR-B.png', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
