  ('TR2-D18321', 'Europa TR2-D18321 O/L Relay 12.0-18.0A', 'europa-tr2-d18321-o-l-relay-12-0-18-0a', 'A TR2-D thermal overload relay whiich meets IEC 60947-1, 60947-4-1, NFC 63-650, VDE 0660, BS 4941 as well as meeting UL, CSA and IEC approvals. Setting range: 12-18A Tripping class (A): 10 Insulation/ operating voltage: 690V/ 600V Frequency limits: 400Hz VDE 0106 protection against finger contact IP2x Dielectric strength @50Hz: IEC 255-5, 6kV Impulse withstand voltage: IEC 801-5, 6kV Tripping threshold (A): 1.14 0.06ln Sensitivity to phase failure: tripping current 25% above In', 'Europa Components & Equipment plc', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/TR2-D09306.webp', 'commande-sectionnement'),
