  ('S201MD40', 'ABB 2CDS271001R0401 S201MD40 MCB SP 10kA', 'abb-2cds271001r0401-s201md40-mcb-sp-10ka', 'ABB is a leader in power and automation technologies, manufacturing low-voltage circuit breakers, switches and control products to protect people, installations and electronic equipment. The System ProM Compact S200 range of miniature circuit breakers have dual tripping mechanisms for overload and short circuit protection. They are suitable for residential, commercial and industrial applications.', 'ABB Ltd', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/S201MB16.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
  ('S201MD32', 'ABB 2CDS271001R0321 S201MD32 MCB SP 10kA', 'abb-2cds271001r0321-s201md32-mcb-sp-10ka', 'ABB is a leader in power and automation technologies, manufacturing low-voltage circuit breakers, switches and control products to protect people, installations and electronic equipment. The System ProM Compact S200 range of miniature circuit breakers have dual tripping mechanisms for overload and short circuit protection. They are suitable for residential, commercial and industrial applications.', 'ABB Ltd', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/S201MB16.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
  ('S201MD20', 'ABB 2CDS271001R0201 S201MD20 MCB SP 10kA', 'abb-2cds271001r0201-s201md20-mcb-sp-10ka', 'ABB is a leader in power and automation technologies, manufacturing low-voltage circuit breakers, switches and control products to protect people, installations and electronic equipment. The System ProM Compact S200 range of miniature circuit breakers have dual tripping mechanisms for overload and short circuit protection. They are suitable for residential, commercial and industrial applications.', 'ABB Ltd', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/S201MB16.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
  ('S201MD16', 'ABB 2CDS271001R0161 S201MD16 MCB SP 10kA', 'abb-2cds271001r0161-s201md16-mcb-sp-10ka', 'ABB is a leader in power and automation technologies, manufacturing low-voltage circuit breakers, switches and control products to protect people, installations and electronic equipment. The System ProM Compact S200 range of miniature circuit breakers have dual tripping mechanisms for overload and short circuit protection. They are suitable for residential, commercial and industrial applications.', 'ABB Ltd', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/S201MB16.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
  ('S201MD10', 'ABB 2CDS271001R0101 S201MD10 MCB SP 10kA', 'abb-2cds271001r0101-s201md10-mcb-sp-10ka', 'ABB is a leader in power and automation technologies, manufacturing low-voltage circuit breakers, switches and control products to protect people, installations and electronic equipment. The System ProM Compact S200 range of miniature circuit breakers have dual tripping mechanisms for overload and short circuit protection. They are suitable for residential, commercial and industrial applications.', 'ABB Ltd', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/S201MB16.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
  ('S201MD6', 'ABB 2CDS271001R0061 S201MD6 MCB SP 10kA', 'abb-2cds271001r0061-s201md6-mcb-sp-10ka', 'ABB is a leader in power and automation technologies that enable utility and industry customers to improve their performance while lowering environmental impact. ABB aims to connect people through technology and are striving towards a more productive, sustainable future. The ABB 2CDS271001R0061 S201MD6 is a single pole, 6A MCB with 10kA breaking capacity and ‘D’ tripping characteristic. Suitable for residential, commercial and industrial applications, the MCB offers protection and control of circuits against overloads and short-circuits, as well as protection for circuits which supply loads with high inrush current at the circuit closing (LV/LV transformers, breakdown lamps).', 'ABB Ltd', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/S201MB16.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
