  ('RI420-L', 'Live RI420-L 4P Rotary Isolator 20A Large Box', 'live-ri420-l-4p-rotary-isolator-20a-large-box', 'Weatherproof Rotary lsolator Switch The LIVE weatherproof rotary isolator switch range is manufactured from tough, durable thermoplastic for outdoor switching protection. Designed with safety in mind, the interlocked front covers can only be removed when in OFF position. Lockable switch prevents tampering. Features:', 'Live Electrical', '{"Current Rating":"20A","Caractéristique 1":"IP Rating IP65.","Caractéristique 2":"Conforms To BS-EN 60947-3.","Caractéristique 3":"Tough durable thermoplastic construction.","Caractéristique 4":"Interlock front cover can only be removed when in the off position.","Operating Voltage":"230V AC.","Caractéristique 5":"Switch can be removed from DIN rail assembly allowing quick and easy first fix.","Caractéristique 6":"Cable entry knockouts on enclosures."}'::jsonb, '/images/products/RI4100.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
