  ('R3PN10C5030BD', 'FuseBox R3PN10C5030BD 3P+N RCBO 50A 30mA 10kA C Curve Type A Bidirectional', 'fusebox-r3pn10c5030bd-3pn-rcbo-50a-30ma-10ka-c-curve-type-a-bidirectional', 'The FuseBox 50A C Curve Bidirectional TPN RCBO is a reliable protection device for three phase distribution boards. It offers switched three pole plus neutral operation with Type A sensitivity, making it ideal for detecting both AC and pulsating DC faults. Designed for demanding environments, it ensures fast disconnection in the event of overloads or earth fault. Specifications Three pole plus neutral switched design Three module width Current ratings from 6A to 50A Type A sensitivity for AC and pulsating DC 30mA earth leakage trip threshold C curve tripping characteristic 10kA breaking capacity Compatible with FuseBox three phase boards Bidirectional current operation', 'Fusebox', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/R2PN10B.png', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
