  ('RTA065030B', 'Fusebox RCBO RTA065030B 50Amps 30mA Type A 6kA B Curve', 'fusebox-rcbo-rta065030b-50amps-30ma-type-a-6ka-b-type', 'The FuseBox RTA065030B RCBO SPN 50A is a high-performance single pole device designed with a B curve for precise tripping characteristics, protecting circuits from overloads and short circuits. This Type A RCBO detects AC and pulsating DC currents, providing reliable protection for 18th Edition compliant installations. It features a 6kA short circuit capacity, making it ideal for heavy-duty circuit protection. Features:', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"50A Single Pole + Neutral (SPN) configuration for circuit protection","Caractéristique 2":"B Curve tripping characteristics for accurate response to overloads and short circuits","Caractéristique 3":"6kA breaking capacity ensures robust short circuit protection","Caractéristique 4":"Type A RCBO detects AC and pulsating DC components","Caractéristique 5":"30mA residual current protection for enhanced electrical safety","Caractéristique 6":"DIN rail mountable for easy installation in consumer units","Caractéristique 7":"Compliant with BS EN 61009-1, ensuring adherence to the highest safety standards","Caractéristique 8":"Mechanical endurance of up to 10,000 cycles","Caractéristique 9":"Neutral fly cable length of 450mm for flexibility during installation","Caractéristique 10":"IP20 protection rating for indoor use"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/RTA0630mATypeA6kABType.png', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
