  ('MAFDD060630B', 'Fusebox Mini Arc Fault Detection Device RCBO 30mA MAFDD 6 Amp', 'fusebox-mini-arc-fault-detection-device-rcbo-30ma-mafdd-6-amp', 'FuseBox’s Mini AFDD is a single module device which is suitable for new and existing FuseBox installations. Designed to protect against ARC FAULTS (Series and Parallel), overload, short circuit and earth leakage. The AFDD06 is double pole RCBO AFDD meaning the Line and Neutral conductors do not have to be disconnected for IR (insulation resistance) testing if the lever is in the OFF position making it the ideal solution any property requiring AFDD protection. Arc fault protection devices (AFDD) are designed to help prevent fires by identifying fire propagating electrical arcs. These can be caused by a number of things such as rodent damage, faulty cable insulation, crushed wires or even loose terminals. These devices combine conventional analogue measurements with microprocessors to quickly analyse data. The quick ‘decision making’ of the unit allows it to detect potential faults befo…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Available in 6A, 10A, 16A, 20A, 32A, 40A","Caractéristique 2":"Retrofit to any FuseBox Consumer Unit","Caractéristique 3":"Single module","Caractéristique 4":"Reduced Height","Caractéristique 5":"Double Pole RCBO 1P+N (switched)","Caractéristique 6":"Type A for AC and pulsating DC sensitivity","Caractéristique 7":"Short circuit capacity of 6kA with a maximum rating of 40A","Caractéristique 8":"LED indication"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/UpdatedMAFDD.jpg', 'detecteurs-arc-afdd'),
  ('G50T', 'FuseBox G50T Tail Gland IP68 50mm', 'fusebox-g50t-tail-gland-ip68-50mm-2', 'FuseBox G50T Tail Gland IP68 50mm – Secure and Reliable Cable Entry for Consumer Units The FuseBox G32T Tail Gland is an IP68-rated M32 cable gland designed to securely and safely seal cable entries into consumer units. Ideal for ensuring protection and maintaining compliance in electrical installations. IP68 Rated Protection: Fully waterproof and dustproof, offering superior protection against harsh environments and outdoor installations. M50 Thread Size: Suitable for standard cable entry points, ensuring compatibility and straightforward installation. Robust Construction: High-quality materials provide reliable long-term performance, even in challenging installation conditions. Enhanced Safety: Prevents moisture and dust ingress, significantly reducing the risk of electrical faults and ensuring compliance with wiring regulations. Easy Installation: Simple fitting design allows rapid…', 'Fusebox', '{"Gland Size":"M50","IP Rating":"IP68 (fully waterproof and dustproof)","Application":"Tail gland for consumer units","Material":"Durable, high-quality construction","Cable Compatibility":"Suitable for meter tails and similar cables","Compliance":"Meets latest BS EN 62444 standards"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/G50T_OPEN_STRAIGHT-scaled.jpg', 'accessoires-raccordement'),
  ('E4PMSH', 'Fusebox E4PMSH 100A TP&N Electricity Meter Isolator Switch', 'fusebox-e4pmsh-100a-tpn-electricity-meter-isolator-switch-2', 'DESCRIPTION COMING SOON', 'Fusebox', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/Screenshot20250611091509.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('E2PMSH', 'Fusebox E2PMSH 100A DP Electricity Meter Isolator Switch', 'fusebox-e2pmsh-100a-dp-electricity-meter-isolator-switch-2', 'DESCRIPTION COMING SOON', 'Fusebox', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/E2PMSH_STRAIGHT-scaled.jpg', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('SPD1MT2', 'FuseBox SPD1MT2 Type 2 Direct to Busbar Surge Protection Device', 'fusebox-spd1mt2-type-2-direct-to-busbar-surge-protection-device-2', 'Protect your electrical installations from damaging voltage spikes with the FuseBox SPD1MT2 Surge Protection Device. Engineered for reliability and ease of installation, the SPD1MT2 offers robust Type 2 surge protection ideal for residential and light commercial applications. This device safeguards sensitive electronics and circuits by diverting transient overvoltages caused by lightning strikes, power surges, or switching operations. Designed to integrate seamlessly with FuseBox consumer units, it ensures long-term protection and compliance with the latest electrical safety standards. Key Features: Direct to busbar design No MCB required Type 2 Surge Protection Compact, DIN rail mountable design Easy installation with clear status indication Compatible with FuseBox consumer units Helps meet 18th Edition Wiring Regulations BS 7671', 'Fusebox', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/Screenshot20250610084150.png', 'interrupteurs-protection-generale'),
  ('F3047MZ', 'Fusebox F3047MZ 47 Way (15/16/16 Triple bank) 100A Main Switch Consumer Unit With SPD', 'fusebox-f3047mz-47-way-151616-triple-bank-100a-main-switch-consumer-unit-with-spd-2', 'The FuseBox F3047MZ consumer unit features 47 usable ways (15/16/16 Triple bank) and comes with 100A Main Switch, A Type 2 Surge Protection device As with all of the fusebox Surge Protected consumer units, the F3047MZ has plenty of space internally for installing both the mini and standard height RCBOs. (See related products below). Additional features to the Fusebox range are captive screws on the front cover, round knockouts on all four sides along with 2 large rectangular knockouts on the rear. This consumer unit is supplied with an installation pack which includes a busbar, an icon label pack, and a updated grommet strip. Dimensions : 762mm x 378mm x 113mm (HxWxD) Updated model replacing F2044MX', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Reinforced grommet strip for enhanced cable protection","Caractéristique 2":"47 Way SPD main switch consumer unit","Caractéristique 3":"Single module Type 2 Surge Protection Device (SPD)","Caractéristique 4":"1mm electro-galvanised steel construction","Caractéristique 5":"RAL 9001 powder-coated finish","Caractéristique 6":"Earth and neutral terminal bars at top","Caractéristique 7":"Removable, raised DIN rail","Caractéristique 8":"Round knock-outs on all faces","Caractéristique 9":"Extra height for RCBOs","Caractéristique 10":"Tail clamp (ACCF) supplied","Caractéristique 11":"Circuit identification labels included","Caractéristique 12":"Captive screws on front cover","Caractéristique 13":"IP20XC rated","Caractéristique 14":"Complies with BS EN61439-3 and 18th Edition"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/F3047MZ-5--scaled.jpg', 'tableaux-domestiques'),
  ('F300GRAZ', 'FuseBox F300GRAZ 63A Type A SPD Garage Consumer Unit c/w B6/B16 MCBs', 'fusebox-f300graz-63a-type-a-spd-garage-consumer-unit-cw-b6b16-mcbs-2', 'FuseBox F300GRAZ The FuseBox F300GRAZ Garage Consumer Unit is a durable and reliable choice for any garage. With the inclusion of RCD Type A MCBs and SPD T2 protection, this unit offers the highest level of safety and protection for your home. With ample space for wiring and clear labelling for easy identification, it provides a worry-free and user-friendly experience.', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"RCD Type A MCBs","Caractéristique 2":"New SPD1MT2 SPD – connects direct to busbar, no MCB required","Caractéristique 3":"Durable Build","Ample Space":"Provides sufficient room for wiring and easy cable management.","Clear Labeling":"Clearly marked circuits for easy identification and troubleshooting."}'::jsonb, '/images/products/F300GRAZ-2--scaled.jpg', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('F3032MDT', 'FuseBox F3032MDT Dual Tariff Consumer Unit 32 Way 2x100A Main Switch', 'fusebox-f3032mdt-dual-tariff-consumer-unit-32-way-2x100a-main-switch-2', 'The new FuseBox F3032MDT 32 usable way Consumer Unit is a fantastic cost effective and quality solution for any suitable application. The most popular consumer unit brand on the market today, Lamplec looks to provide you the service you need with every FuseBox order. Dimensions – Height 515mm x Width 380mm x Depth 116mm Updated model replacing F2030MDT', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Upgraded reinforced grommet strip included","Caractéristique 2":"Earth and neutral terminal bars on top of consumer unit","Caractéristique 3":"Removable and raised DIN rail","Caractéristique 4":"Round knock-outs on all faces (20mm & 32mm top and bottom, 40m on sides)","Caractéristique 5":"Extra height for RCBOs (standard and mini RCBOs available on our store)","Caractéristique 6":"1mm electro-galvanised steel (zinc)","Caractéristique 7":"Busbar shroud","Caractéristique 8":"RAL 9001 powder-coated arctic white finish to give a stylish look","Caractéristique 9":"Circuit identification labels (Full label pack)","Caractéristique 10":"Captive screws on front cover as standard for ease of installation","Caractéristique 11":"IP20XC Rated","Caractéristique 12":"BS EN61439-3 compliant"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/F3032MDT-5--scaled.jpg', 'tableaux-domestiques'),
