  ('F3004E', 'FuseBox F3004E 4 Way Empty Consumer Unit Enclosure', 'fusebox-f3004e-4-way-empty-consumer-unit-enclosure-2', 'The FuseBox F3004E is an empty 4 way metal enclosure allows for configurations including mains switches, RDCs, RCBOs, MCBs and more. Ideal for use as a garage unit, or an additional breakout box. FuseBox manufactures a range of high quality domestic circuit protection. This includes main switch, dual RCD, electric vehicle and isolation consumer units along with a range of devices such as RCBOs, MCBs, AFDDs and accessories. Dimensions – Height 260mm x Width 156mm x Depth 92.5mm Updated Model Replacing F1004E', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"4 useable ways","Caractéristique 2":"Earth ; Neutral Bar","Caractéristique 3":"Busbar","Caractéristique 4":"AMD Complaint","Caractéristique 5":"Standard Din Rail","Caractéristique 6":"25mm ; 32mm knockouts top and bottom"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/F3004E-scaled.jpg', 'coffrets-enveloppes'),
