  ('F3004RA', 'FuseBox F3004RA 4 Way 63A Type A RCD Consumer Unit', 'fusebox-consumer-unit-63a-4-way-rcd-2', 'The new Fusebox F3004RA 4 usable way Consumer Unit is a fantastic cost effective and quality solution for any suitable application. The F3004RA has the following specification: Dimensions – Height 255mm x Width 162mm x Depth 116mm Updated Model Replacing F2004RA', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"63A Type A RCD Protection","Caractéristique 2":"18th edition","Caractéristique 3":"Earth and neutral terminal bars on top of consumer unit","Caractéristique 4":"Removable and raised DIN rail","Caractéristique 5":"Round knock-outs on all faces (20mm & 32mm top and bottom, 40m on sides)","Caractéristique 6":"Extra height for RCBOs (standard and mini RCBOs available on our store)","Caractéristique 7":"1mm electro-galvanised steel (zinc)","Caractéristique 8":"RAL 9001 powder-coated arctic white finish to give a stylish look","Caractéristique 9":"Tail clamp compatible (To be ordered separately ACCF)","Caractéristique 10":"Circuit identification labels (Full label pack)","Caractéristique 11":"Upgraded Grommet Strip included","Caractéristique 12":"Captive screws on front cover as standard for ease of installation","Caractéristique 13":"IP20XC Rated","Caractéristique 14":"BS EN61439-3 compliant"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/F3004RA2-scaled.jpg', 'tableaux-domestiques'),
  ('F300GRA', 'Fusebox F300GRA – Garage Unit 63A RCD 1X6A 1X16A', 'fusebox-f300gra-garage-unit-63a-rcd-1x6a-1x16a-2', 'The FuseBox AMD3 compliant large, robust metal garage consumer unit is finished in smooth white with conduit knockouts on all planes and large knockouts to the rear. Removable key slot din rail together with earth and neutral terminal bars positioned at the top, including a spirit level, ensure a quick and easy installation. A Tail clamp is also provided to ensure connections to the incomer are secure. Blanks and circuit identification labels are supplied with the unit. Key Features: Dimensions – (H) 260mm (W) 156mm (D) 94mm Updated model replacing F100GRA', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"63A 30Ma RCD","Caractéristique 2":"AMD3 Compliant","Caractéristique 3":"Supplied with 1 x 6A & 1 x 16A MCB’s","Caractéristique 4":"Self closing lid","Caractéristique 5":"25mm tail clamp","Caractéristique 6":"Smooth White Finish RAL9003","Caractéristique 7":"Integral spirit level","Caractéristique 8":"Comprehensive label sheet"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/F300GRA-scaled.jpg', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('F3031MZ', 'Fusebox F3031MZ 31 Way (15/16 double bank) 100A Main Switch Consumer Unit With SPD', 'fusebox-f3031mz-31-way-1516-double-bank-100a-main-switch-consumer-unit-with-spd-2', 'The FuseBox F3031MZ consumer unit features 31 usable ways (15/16 double bank) and comes with 100A Main Switch, A Type 2 Surge Protection device As with all of the fusebox Surge Protected consumer units, the F3031MZ has plenty of space internally for installing both the mini and standard height RCBOs. (See related products below). Additional features to the Fusebox range are captive screws on the front cover, round knockouts on all four sides along with 2 large rectangular knockouts on the rear. This consumer unit is supplied with an installation pack which includes a busbar, an icon label pack, and a updated grommet strip. Dimensions : 512mm x 378mm x 113mm (HxWxD) Updated model replacing F2029MX', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Reinforced grommet strip for enhanced cable protection","Caractéristique 2":"31 Way SPD main switch consumer unit","Caractéristique 3":"100A main switch incomer","Caractéristique 4":"Single module Type 2 Surge Protection Device (SPD)","Caractéristique 5":"1mm electro-galvanised steel construction","Caractéristique 6":"RAL 9001 powder-coated finish","Caractéristique 7":"Earth and neutral terminal bars at top","Caractéristique 8":"Removable, raised DIN rail","Caractéristique 9":"Round knock-outs on all faces","Caractéristique 10":"Extra height for RCBOs","Caractéristique 11":"Tail clamp (ACCF) supplied","Caractéristique 12":"Circuit identification labels included","Caractéristique 13":"Captive screws on front cover","Caractéristique 14":"IP20XC rated","Caractéristique 15":"Complies with BS EN61439-3 and 18th Edition"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/F3031MZ-scaled.jpg', 'tableaux-domestiques'),
