  ('F3012M', 'FuseBox F3012M 12 Way 100A Main Switch Consumer Unit', 'fusebox-f3012m-12-way-100a-main-switch-consumer-unit-2', 'Introducing the FuseBox F3012M 12 Way Main Switch Consumer Unit – the ultimate solution for all your residential power needs! Designed to provide maximum efficiency and safety, this consumer unit is perfect for powering all your essential appliances and protecting your home against electrical faults. With its sturdy build and sleek design, the FuseBox F3012M 12 Way Main Switch Consumer Unit is a reliable and durable choice for any home. Its compact size and easy-to-use design make it simple to install and operate, while its high-quality components ensure reliable performance and protection against electrical faults. This consumer unit features a 12-way main switch and RCBOs (Residual Current Circuit Breaker with Overload protection) to ensure that your home’s electrical circuits are protected from overloading, short circuits, and electrical faults. Its advanced features allow you to c…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Reinforced grommet strip for enhanced cable protection","Caractéristique 2":"12 Way main switch consumer unit","Caractéristique 3":"Extra way for expanded circuit capacity","Caractéristique 4":"100A main isolator included","Caractéristique 5":"Constructed from 1mm electro-galvanised steel","Caractéristique 6":"RAL 9001 powder-coated finish","Caractéristique 7":"Earth and neutral terminal bars at top","Caractéristique 8":"Removable, raised DIN rail","Caractéristique 9":"Round knock-outs on all faces","Caractéristique 10":"Extra height for RCBOs","Caractéristique 11":"Tail clamp (ACCF) supplied","Caractéristique 12":"Circuit identification labels included","Caractéristique 13":"Captive screws on front cover","Caractéristique 14":"IP20XC rated","Caractéristique 15":"Complies with BS EN61439-3"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/F3012M-3--scaled.jpg', 'tableaux-domestiques'),
  ('F3008M', 'Fusebox F3008M 8 Way 100A Main Switch Consumer Unit', 'fusebox-f3008m-8-way-100a-main-switch-consumer-unit-2', 'The F3008M 8 way Fusebox Consumer Unit is an AMD3 compliant robust metal fuse box which is finished in a smooth white with conduit knockouts on all planes and large knockouts to the rear. A removeable key slot din rail together with earth and neutral terminal bars positioned at the top ensure a quick and easy installation. Blanks and circuit identification labels are supplied with every Fusebox board. The fusebox F3008M main switch consumer unit features 8 usable ways and comes with 100A Main Switch Incomer and a 32mm tails clamp. You also have space to fit a surge protection device too. As with all of the FuseBox boards, the F3008M has more than enough space for installation of both the mini and standard height RCBO Additional features include captive screws on the front cover, round knockouts on all four sides along with 2 large rectangular knockouts on the rear. This consumer unit…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Reinforced grommet strip for cable protection","Caractéristique 2":"8 Way main switch consumer unit","Caractéristique 3":"Extra way compared to (F2007M)","Caractéristique 4":"100A main switch incomer","Caractéristique 5":"EN 61439-3 compliant","Caractéristique 6":"Earth and neutral terminal bars at top","Caractéristique 7":"Removable, raised DIN rail","Caractéristique 8":"Round knock-outs on all sides","Caractéristique 9":"Extra height for RCBOs","Caractéristique 10":"Circuit identification labels included","Caractéristique 11":"Captive screws on front cover","Caractéristique 12":"Compatible with 100A tail clamps","Compact size":"234mm x 255mm x 113mm"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/F3008M-scaled.jpg', 'tableaux-domestiques'),
  ('F3004M', 'FuseBox F3004M 4 Way 100A Main Switch Consumer Unit', 'fusebox-f3004m-4-way-100a-main-switch-consumer-unit-2', 'The FuseBox F3004M is a compact 4-way consumer unit featuring a 100A double pole main switch. Its 6-module configuration allows for flexible circuit arrangements, and it complies with BS EN 61439-3 standards. Constructed from durable metal with a smooth white powder-coated finish (RAL 9001), this unit includes a reinforced grommet strip for enhanced cable protection. Ideal for residential applications requiring a reliable and safe power distribution solution. Key Features Dimensions (H x W x D) 263mm (H) x 162mm (W) x 116mm (D).', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"4 usable ways including 2 blank modules for future expansion","Caractéristique 2":"IP2X ingress protection rating","Caractéristique 3":"Earth and neutral terminal bars included","Caractéristique 4":"Supplied with 100A main switch and blank modules","Knockouts":"20mm and 32mm top and bottom","Caractéristique 5":"Compatible with RCBOs, RCDs, MCBs, and accessories","Caractéristique 6":"Complies with BS EN 61439-3 and 18th Edition AMD3 regulations","Caractéristique 7":"DIN rail included for quick device installation","Caractéristique 8":"Padlock able front cover for added security (padlock not included)","Caractéristique 9":"Steel construction with RAL9003 white epoxy finish","Caractéristique 10":"Ideal as a garage or outbuilding consumer unit","Caractéristique 11":"Suitable for residential, commercial, or light industrial use","Caractéristique 12":"Colour / Finish White"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/F3004M-3--scaled.jpg', 'tableaux-domestiques'),
  ('RTN306C-030N', 'Live Electrical 3P+N 6Amp C Curve 30mA Type A RCBO', 'live-electrical-3p-n-6-63a-c-curve-30ma-type-a-rcbo-2', 'Live Electrical: This RCBO is specifically designed for Live Electrical Three Phase Distribution Boards, offering advanced protection and reliability. Combining the functions of an RCD (Residual Current Device) and an MCB (Miniature Circuit Breaker), it safeguards against overloads, short circuits, and earth leakage faults. Its Type A functionality ensures detection of both AC (Alternating Current) and pulsating DC (Direct Current) residual currents, making it ideal for modern electrical systems with sensitive equipment. Key Features of Live Electrical Three Phase RCBO 6A C Curve: Applications: Specifications:', 'Live Electrical', '{"Rated current":"6A for precise and safe load handling.","Fault current":"10kA, ensuring robust protection against high fault conditions.","RCD trip rating":"30mA to safeguard against harmful leakage currents.","Curve C":"Provides fast disconnection, suitable for residential and light commercial applications.","Type A":"Detects both AC and pulsating DC residual currents for enhanced safety.","Caractéristique 1":"Designed specifically for Live Electrical Three Phase Distribution Boards.","Caractéristique 2":"Perfect for industrial and commercial environments with modern electrical loads.","Caractéristique 3":"Ideal for systems with sensitive equipment prone to pulsating DC leakage currents.","Rated Current":"6A","Fault Current":"10kA","RCD Trip Rating":"30mA","Curve Type":"C","RCD Type":"A (AC and pulsating DC detection)","Compliance":"BS EN 61009"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/RTN50C0303PN-e1755599447487.png', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('RTN306B-030N', 'Live Electrical 3P+N 6Amp B Curve 30mA Type A RCBO', 'live-electrical-3p-n-6-63a-b-curve-30ma-type-a-rcbo-2', 'Live Electrical: This RCBO is specifically designed for Live Electrical Three Phase Distribution Boards, offering advanced protection and reliability. Combining the functions of an RCD (Residual Current Device) and an MCB (Miniature Circuit Breaker), it safeguards against overloads, short circuits, and earth leakage faults. Its Type A functionality ensures detection of both AC (Alternating Current) and pulsating DC (Direct Current) residual currents, making it ideal for modern electrical systems with sensitive equipment. Key Features of Live Electrical Three Phase RCBO 6A B Curve: Applications: Specifications:', 'Live Electrical', '{"Rated current":"6A for precise and safe load handling.","Fault current":"10kA, ensuring robust protection against high fault conditions.","RCD trip rating":"30mA to safeguard against harmful leakage currents.","Curve B":"Provides fast disconnection, suitable for residential and light commercial applications.","Type A":"Detects both AC and pulsating DC residual currents for enhanced safety.","Caractéristique 1":"Designed specifically for Live Electrical Three Phase Distribution Boards.","Caractéristique 2":"Perfect for industrial and commercial environments with modern electrical loads.","Caractéristique 3":"Ideal for systems with sensitive equipment prone to pulsating DC leakage currents.","Rated Current":"6A","Fault Current":"10kA","RCD Trip Rating":"30mA","Curve Type":"B","RCD Type":"A (AC and pulsating DC detection)","Compliance":"BS EN 61009"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/RTN50C0303PN-e1755599447487.png', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('RA106C-030', 'Live Electrical 6Amp 10kA 30mA C Curve Type A RCBO', 'live-electrical-6-63a-10ka-30ma-c-curve-type-a-rcbo-2', 'Description & features High immunity RCBO is an ideal solution for providing over current & earth leakage protection. They ensure reliable protection to people & installation in networks having pulsated DC, harmonics & transients currents, while maintaining continuity of supply by reducing nuisance tripping. Handle can be locked with pad-lock to prevent unwanted operation for safety.', 'Live Electrical', '{"Rated current (In)":"6A","Rated Voltage (Ue)":"230V AC.","Breaking capacity (Icn)":"10kA.","Rated residual current":"30mA","Tripping characteristics":"C Curve","Electrical endurance":"4000 cycles.","Mechanical endurance":"10000 cycles.","Caractéristique 1":"Complies with BS EN 61009-1.","Type":"A"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/RA140B030.png', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
  ('RA106B-030', 'Live Electrical 6Amp 10kA 30mA B Curve Type A RCBO', 'live-electrical-6-63a-10ka-30ma-b-curve-type-a-rcbo-2', 'Description & features High immunity RCBO is an ideal solution for providing over current & earth leakage protection. They ensure reliable protection to people & installation in networks having pulsated DC, harmonics & transients currents, while maintaining continuity of supply by reducing nuisance tripping. Handle can be locked with pad-lock to prevent unwanted operation for safety.', 'Live Electrical', '{"Rated current (In)":"6A","Rated Voltage (Ue)":"230V AC.","Breaking capacity (Icn)":"10kA.","Rated residual current":"30mA","Tripping characteristics":"B Curve","Electrical endurance":"4000 cycles.","Mechanical endurance":"10000 cycles.","Caractéristique 1":"Complies with BS EN 61009-1.","Type":"A"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/RA140B030.png', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
