  ('ADRBTPN', 'Fusebox ADRBTPN Busbar Single Module DIN Rail Mounting Blank', 'fusebox-adrbtpn-busbar-single-module-din-rail-mounting-blank-2', 'Features : ADRBTPN Busbar Single Module DIN Rail Mounting Blank for use with TPN boards. If you want a triple pole blank you need 3 of these. Key Features:', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Streamlined installation process","Caractéristique 2":"Organized and optimized assembly","Caractéristique 3":"Enhanced productivity and workflow","Caractéristique 4":"Error reduction","Caractéristique 5":"Robust and durable construction","Caractéristique 6":"Single module / 1 modular width","Product code":"ADRBTPN","Manufacturer":"FuseBox","Guarantee":"1 Year"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/Screenshot20250609091136.png', 'accessoires-raccordement'),
