  ('A65E06MGY', 'FuseBox A65E06MGY Grey IP65 6 Module Consumer Unit', 'fusebox-a65e06mgy-grey-ip65-6-module-consumer-unit-2', 'Overview The FuseBox A65E06MgY is a compact grey 6 module IP65 empty enclosure. Key Features', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"6 usable ways","Caractéristique 2":"Earth and neutral terminal bars at the top","Caractéristique 3":"Removable and raised DIN rail","Caractéristique 4":"Round knock-outs on all faces","Caractéristique 5":"Identification label pack","Caractéristique 6":"Captive front cover screws","Caractéristique 7":"Complete with tail clamp which can be fitted in two positions depending on configuration and removable din rail making first fix easy.","Caractéristique 8":"Designed for external and internal use.","Caractéristique 9":"Base and front cover can be sealed with wire tag for security and drop down lid to ensure IP65 rating.","Caractéristique 10":"Additional Information","Caractéristique 11":"Width 182mm x Height 269.6mm x Depth 103mm","Caractéristique 12":"IP65","Caractéristique 13":"BS EN61439-3"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/A65E06MGY.jpg', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('AGSW', 'FuseBox AGSW Grommet Strip 5m White', 'fusebox-agsw-grommet-strip-5m-white-2', 'Fusebox AGSW White Grommet Strip (5 Metres) is made from polyethylene and designed for use with consumer units to provide efficient cable protection at panel edges whilst encouraging a neat, clean professional functionality. This flexible adhesive-free grommet strip will help to safeguard cables from wear and wear when routed through sharp-edged cut out sections whilst reducing trip hazard and improving aesthetics. Key Features of Fusebox White Grommet Strip', 'Fusebox', '{"Product code":"AGSW","Length":"5 metres","Caractéristique 1":"Made from white polyethylene","Caractéristique 2":"Protect cables when routed through sharp-edged cut out sections","Caractéristique 3":"Provides protection at panel edges","Caractéristique 4":"Easily and securely applied without adhesive","Caractéristique 5":"Reduce cable wear and tear","Caractéristique 6":"For use with consumer units","Caractéristique 7":"Allows a neat, clean professional finish","Caractéristique 8":"Reduced trip hazard","Caractéristique 9":"Highly flexible"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/agsww.jpg', 'accessoires-raccordement'),
