  ('NHVM32518', 'Wylex NM160 250A 18-Way 3P+N Panel Board', 'wylex-18-way-panel-board', 'TP or 4P Switch Disconnector or direct connection incomer options available with a NHVA part number prefix. Accepts Wylex NH VM160 fixed or adjustable SP or TP MCCBs from 16A to 160A. Accepts both integral incoming metering (Pulsed output/Modbus or MID) and integral Type 1, Type 2, or Type 1 and 2 surge protection. Form 3B Type 2 Form of Separation, IP3X with door closed, Icw = 25kA for 1s, Type tested and ASTA certified. RAL 7035 Grey powder coat finish. Designed and manufactured in the UK to BS EN 61439-3.', 'Wylex', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Form 3B Type 2 form of separation","Caractéristique 2":"IP3X with door closed – steel manufacture","Caractéristique 3":"Type tested and ASTA certified","Fault rating":"25kA for 1 second","Caractéristique 4":"3-phase, 3-pole configuration","Main switch rated current":"250A","Caractéristique 5":"18 Type B ways","Caractéristique 6":"Lockable unit","Dimensions (H x W x D)":"1361 x 700 x 198mm","Caractéristique 7":"BS EN 61439-2"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/NHVM32518-1.jpg', 'tableaux-triphases-commerciaux'),
  ('NHVM32512', 'Wylex VM160 250A 12-Way 3P+N Panel Board', 'wylex-12-way-panel-board', 'TP or 4P Switch Disconnector or direct connection incomer options available with a NHVA part number prefix. Accepts Wylex NH VM160 fixed or adjustable SP or TP MCCBs from 16A to 160A. Accepts both integral incoming metering (Pulsed output/Modbus or MID) and integral Type 1, Type 2, or Type 1 and 2 surge protection. Form 3B Type 2 Form of Separation, IP3X with door closed, Icw = 25kA for 1s, Type tested and ASTA certified. RAL 7035 Grey powder coat finish. Designed and manufactured in the UK to BS EN 61439-3.', 'Wylex', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Form 3B Type 2 form of separation","Caractéristique 2":"IP3X with door closed – steel manufacture","Caractéristique 3":"Type tested and ASTA certified","Fault rating":"25kA for 1 second","Caractéristique 4":"3-phase, 3-pole configuration","Main switch rated current":"250A","Caractéristique 5":"12 Type ‘B’ ways","Caractéristique 6":"Lockable unit","Dimensions (H x W x D)":"1132 x 700 x 198mm","Caractéristique 7":"BS EN 61439-2"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/NHVM32512.jpg', 'tableaux-triphases-commerciaux'),
  ('NHVM32506', 'Wylex VM160 250A 6 Way 3P+N Panel Board', 'wylex-panel-board-6-way', 'TP or 4P Switch Disconnector or direct connection incomer options available with a NHVA part number prefix. Accepts Wylex NH VM160 fixed or adjustable SP or TP MCCBs from 16A to 160A. Accepts both integral incoming metering (Pulsed output/Modbus or MID) and integral Type 1, Type 2, or Type 1 and 2 surge protection. Form 3B Type 2 Form of Separation, IP3X with door closed, Icw = 25kA for 1s, Type tested and ASTA certified. RAL 7035 Grey powder coat finish. Designed and manufactured in the UK to BS EN 61439-3.', 'Wylex', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Form 3B Type 2 form of separation","Caractéristique 2":"IP3X with door closed – steel manufacture","Caractéristique 3":"Type tested and ASTA certified","Fault rating":"25kA for 1 second","Caractéristique 4":"3-phase, 3-pole configuration","Main switch rated current":"250A","Caractéristique 5":"6 Type B ways","Caractéristique 6":"Lockable unit","Dimensions (H x W x D)":"902 x 700 x 198mm","Caractéristique 7":"BS EN 61439-2"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/NHVM32506.jpg', 'tableaux-triphases-commerciaux'),
  ('EPP-1253P-1754431024', 'ABB 3P Sw Incoming Kit 125A', 'abb-sw-incoming-kit', 'ABB is a leader in power and automation technologies that enable utility and industry customers to improve their performance while lowering environmental impact. The Low Voltage Products division manufactures low-voltage circuit breakers, switches, control products, wiring accessories, enclosures and cable systems to protect people, installations and electronic equipment from electrical overload. The division also makes KNX systems that integrate and automate a building’s electrical installations, ventilation systems, and security and data communication networks The ABB EPP-1253P is a switch incoming connection kit which is triple pole and has a rated current of 125A. This kit is comprised of a cooper connection kit and fittings, an incoming device, a cover plate and an instruction leaflet.', 'ABB Ltd', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/ABB.jpeg', 'accessoires-raccordement'),
  ('GM14-3NPS', 'Garo 1 Row 3 Showers 40A EV Charger Non-Priority Distribution Board / Consumer Unit', 'garo-1-row-3-showers-40a-ev-charger-non-priority-distribution-board-consumer-unit', 'Protect your main incoming supply with GAROs Priority & Non-Priority Boards. Effective and easy to install solutions to safely manage the load between multiple electric showers or an electric shower & EV Charger. Garo Priority & Non-Priority Boards are designed to facilitate the use of multiple electric showers which are being supplied from a domestic single phase supply. These units can also operate in conjunction with other appliances, such as EV Chargers, Hot Tubs or Heat Pumps. These boards will disconnect a shower or other appliance, as required, in order to safely manage the total house load and protect the main fuse. All priority & non-priority products are fitted with type A RCBO/RCCB, which are suitable for electric showers up to 9.5KW & electric vehicle chargers with DC leakage protection. NON-PRIORITY Restricts power to one appliance respectively at a time. Either appliance…', 'Garo', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/GM143NPS.jpg', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('GM10-PS63', 'Garo 1 Row 2 Showers 63A EV Charger Priority Distribution Board / Consumer Unit', 'garo-1-row-2-showers-63a-ev-charger-priority-distribution-board-consumer-unit', 'Protect your main incoming supply with GAROs Priority & Non-Priority Boards. Effective and easy to install solutions to safely manage the load between multiple electric showers or an electric shower & EV Charger. Garo Priority & Non-Priority Boards are designed to facilitate the use of multiple electric showers which are being supplied from a domestic single phase supply. These units can also operate in conjunction with other appliances, such as EV Chargers, Hot Tubs or Heat Pumps. These boards will disconnect a shower or other appliance, as required, in order to safely manage the total house load and protect the main fuse. All priority & non-priority products are fitted with type A RCBO/RCCB, which are suitable for electric showers up to 9.5KW & electric vehicle chargers with DC leakage protection. PRIORITY – Allows an appliance (A) to be given priority of use over the second applian…', 'Garo', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/Screenshot20220726160420.JPG', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('TIME16S', 'Live Electrical Single Module Digital Timer', 'live-electrical-single-module-digital-timer', 'Single module digital timer for installation inside of a consumer unit. Ideal for controlling circuits quickly and easily .', '', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/TIME.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('MCFS100/3F', 'Live Electrical Metal 125A Fused Switch c/w 3 Fuses (63/80/100A)', 'live-electrical-metal-125a-fused-switch-cw-3-fuses-2', 'Designed for easy installation and connection of sub-mains or system extensions. The Fuse holder accommodates up to 100 Amp rated fuse 58mm long x 22mm diameter (not included).', 'Live Electrical', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Live Metal Clad Fused Isolator Switch MCFS100 SP&N 100 Amp Fuse Included","Caractéristique 2":"Single Phase Free P&P","Caractéristique 3":"Live Metal Fused Isolator Switch Box MCFS100 SP&N 100 Amp Single Phase","Caractéristique 4":"Ideal for the protection and isolation of incoming supplies","Caractéristique 5":"All of the metal construction is in accord with Amendment 3","Caractéristique 6":"Single Phase and switched neutral","Caractéristique 7":"35mm² max cable capacity","Caractéristique 8":"Manufactured to BS EN6143-3 complaint.","Caractéristique 9":"Includes a 100 Amp Fuse (Various Brands)","Caractéristique 10":"CE approved","Caractéristique 11":"With drop down metal lid","Caractéristique 12":"The Fuse holder has a lockout facility","Maximum load":"100 Amp, 230V AC 50Hz","Caractéristique 13":"2 x 32mm knockouts on the top and bottom faces, 2 x 40mm knockouts on each side face","Dimensions":"253mm x 125mm x 109mm","Caractéristique 14":"The Fuse holder accommodates up to 100 Amp rated fuse 58mm long x 22mm diameter"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/mcfs1003f.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('AFD6B', 'Live Electrical B Curve Arc Fault Detection Device Combined RCBO 6A', 'live-electrical-6a-b-curve-arc-fault-detection-device-with-rcbo-2', 'Product Description 6kA Arc Fault Detection Device With RCBO The AFD series arc fault protector combines arc fault detection with RCBO protection. The AFD series arc fault protector has the functions of short circuit protection, overload protection, leakage protection and arc fault protection. AFD series arc fault protection devices are designed for use on circuits rated up to 32A and below to protect against arc faults, overloads, short circuits and leakage. When the AFD series arc fault protection devices detect the presence of arc faults in the line, they will automatically trip and isolate the circuit. Specification:', 'Live Electrical', '{"Rated working voltage (Ue)":"AC230V","Rated operating frequency":"±50Hz 2%","Rated insulation voltage (Ui)":"400V","Rated impulse withstand voltage (Uimp)":"4kV","Rated current (In)":"6A","Number of N poles":"1P+N","Caractéristique 1":"Protection Curve B","Operating short-circuit capacity (Ics)":"6kA","Rated residual operating currentI?n":"30mA","RCD Type":"A","Insulation material group":"?a","Ambient Temperature range":"-5~40 o C","Storage Temperature range":"-25 o C ~ +55 o C"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/AFD6B.jpeg', 'detecteurs-arc-afdd'),
  ('LFIS100', 'Live Electrical Switcfuse With 80 & 100A Fuse Plus Shroud LFIS100', 'live-electrical-100a-switchfuse-cw-80-and-100a-fuse-and-shroud-2', 'The Live Electrical Switchfuse With 80 & 100A Fuse Plus Shroud is manufactured from non combustable bakelite material and is supplied with a 80amp and 100amp fuse. The Switchfuse can accomdate a manimum cable capacity of 35mm2 and comes complete with a cable shroud.', 'Live Electrical', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Supplied With a 80amp and 100amp Fuse","Caractéristique 2":"Complete With Cable Shroud","Caractéristique 3":"Manufactured From Non-Combustable Bakelite Material","Caractéristique 4":"Manufactured to BS EN 60947-3","Caractéristique 5":"Ideal For The Protection & Isolation Of Incoming Supplies Up To 100A","Dimensions":"128mm x 82mm x 54mm (W x H x D)"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/lfis100.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('MAC4P40', 'Live Electrical 4 Pole 40A AC Contactor', 'live-electrical-4-pole-40a-ac-contactor-2', 'Compact modular design', '', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Compact modular design","Caractéristique 2":"Elegant appearance mounting instruction diagram is appended for convenient operation","Caractéristique 3":"No noise during operation"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/mac4p40.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('MAC4P25', 'Live Electrical 4 Pole 25A AC Contactor', 'live-electrical-4-pole-25a-ac-contactor-2', 'Compact modular design Elegant appearance mounting instruction diagram is appended for convenient operation No noise during operation Dimensions 82mm x 36mm x 68mm (L x W x D).', '', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/mac4p25.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('MAC2P40', 'Live Electrical 2 Pole 40A AC Contactor', 'live-electrical-2-pole-40a-ac-contactor-2', 'Compact modular design and modularization design', '', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Compact modular design and modularization design","Caractéristique 2":"Elegant appearance. A mounting instruction diagram is appended for convenient operation","Caractéristique 3":"No noise during operation","Caractéristique 4":"AC contactor for domestic applications & 35mm Din rail Mounting","Caractéristique 5":"Suitable for housing within a consumer unit or modular enclosure","Caractéristique 6":"Electric rating up to 40A","Caractéristique 7":"Complies with as EN 60948-4-1","Caractéristique 8":"Dimensions 82mm x 36mm x 68mm (L x W x D)"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/mac2p401.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('MAC2P25', 'Live Electrical 2 Pole 25A AC Contactor', 'live-electrical-2-pole-25a-ac-contactor-2', 'Compact modular design', '', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Compact modular design","Caractéristique 2":"Elegant appearance mounting instruction diagram is appended for convenient operation","Caractéristique 3":"No noise during operation","Caractéristique 4":"Complies with as EN 60948-4-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/mac2p25.png', 'commande-sectionnement'),
  ('MCUBLANK', 'Live Electrical Metal Blank Piece for LHMC and TPN Range', 'live-electrical-metal-blank-piece-for-lhmc-and-tpn-range-2', 'Live Electrical Metal Blank for Domestic Consumer Units MCUBLANK Suitable for the Domestic Range of LHMC Fuse Boards.', '', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/blank.jpeg', 'accessoires-raccordement'),
  ('PCUBLANK', 'Live Electrical Plastic Consumer Unit Blank', 'live-electrical-plastic-consumer-unit-blank', 'Quality plastic consumer unit blank.', '', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Quality plastic consumer unit blank.","Caractéristique 2":"Shaped like an MCB, it is used to blank off single module unused ways in distribution boards."}'::jsonb, '/images/products/PCUBLANK.jpeg', 'accessoires-raccordement'),
  ('S201MB32', 'ABB 2CDS271001R0325 S201MB32 MCB SP 10KA', 'abb-2cds271001r0325-sp-mcb-b32a-10ka-2', 'ABB is a leader in power and automation technologies, manufacturing low-voltage circuit breakers, switches and control products to protect people, installations and electronic equipment. The System ProM Compact S200 range of miniature circuit breakers have dual tripping mechanisms for overload and short circuit protection. They are suitable for residential, commercial and industrial applications. The ABB 2CDS271001R0325 S201M-B32 is a 32A 10kA single pole Type B MCB.', 'ABB Ltd', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/S201MB32.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
  ('AFDD060630B', 'Fusebox Arc Fault Detection Device RCBO 30mA AFDD 6Amp', 'fusebox-arc-fault-detection-device-rcbo-30ma-afdd06', 'FuseBox’s AFDD is a single module device which is suitable for new and existing FuseBox installations. Designed to protect against ARC FAULTS (Series and Parallel), overload, short circuit and earth leakage. The AFDD06 is double pole RCBO AFDD meaning the Line and Neutral conductors do not have to be disconnected for IR (insulation resistance) testing if the lever is in the OFF position making it the ideal solution any property requiring AFDD protection. Arc fault protection devices (AFDD) are designed to help prevent fires by identifying fire propagating electrical arcs. These can be caused by a number of things such as rodent damage, faulty cable insulation, crushed wires or even loose terminals. These devices combine conventional analogue measurements with microprocessors to quickly analyse data. The quick ‘decision making’ of the unit allows it to detect potential faults before th…', 'Fusebox', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Available in 6A, 10A, 16A, 20A, 32A, 40A","Caractéristique 2":"Retrofit to any FuseBox Consumer Unit","Caractéristique 3":"Single module","Caractéristique 4":"Double Pole RCBO 1P+N (switched)","Caractéristique 5":"Type A for AC and pulsating DC sensitivity","Caractéristique 6":"Short circuit capacity of 6kA with a maximum rating of 40A","Caractéristique 7":"LED indication","Caractéristique 8":"Fully compliant and 3rd party tested to BS EN 62606 / IEC 61009-1"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/AFDD06faultdetectiondevice30mA.png', 'detecteurs-arc-afdd'),
  ('TPN06-125', 'Live Electrical 6 Ways With 4 Pole 125A Main Switch Incomer', 'live-electrical-6-way-three-phase-board-cw-125a-main-switch-2', 'Live Electrical Distrution Board. Specifications: Supplied with main switch incomer Section neutral & earth terminals both sides Fully enclosed busbar Complete shrouding for main incomer and link Removable gland plate for easy of cable entry Rated Voltage: AC380V/415V 50/60Hz Maximum loading current to 125A/250A Standard: BS EN61439-3 Dimensions: 560mm (H) x 465mm (W) x 105mm (D)', 'Live Electrical', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/TPN06-125.png', 'tableaux-triphases-commerciaux'),
  ('TPN08-125', 'Live Electrical 8 Ways with 4 Pole 125A Main Switch Incomer', 'live-electrical-8-way-three-phase-board-cw-125a-main-switch-2', 'Live Electrical Distrution Board. Specifications: Supplied with main switch incomer Section neutral & earth terminals both sides Fully enclosed busbar Complete shrouding for main incomer and link Removable gland plate for easy of cable entry Rated Voltage: AC380V/415V 50/60Hz Maximum loading current to 125A/250A Standard: BS EN61439-3 Dimensions: 614mm (H) x 465mm (W) x 105mm (D)', 'Live Electrical', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/TPN08-125.png', 'tableaux-triphases-commerciaux'),
  ('MMGUMS616', 'Live Electrical 4 Way C/W 100A Main Switch Mini Garage Unit + B6A/B16A MCB', 'live-electrical-garage-unit-cw-100a-main-switch-616a-mcb-2', 'Consumer unit enclosures supplied with blank, Neutral Cable, Busbar, Neutrual & Earth Terminal bar, Din Rail', '', '{"Caractéristique 1":"Fully enclosed metal construction body with drop down metal lid.","Caractéristique 2":"Multiple circular cable entry knock-outs (25&32mm) on the top and bottom, 40mm on the sides, and back plus larger rear slots.","Caractéristique 3":"Raised key holes for secure easy installation.","Caractéristique 4":"Raised Din rail improves cable routing.","Caractéristique 5":"Modern style finished in white polyester powder coating to RAL9010.","Caractéristique 6":"Large and accessible wiring space, with extra space for RCBOs , MCBs,","Caractéristique 7":"Flexible connection allows for various configurations of protected ways.","Dimensions":"125 X 183 X 110mm"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/mmgum1.png', 'tableaux-ve-garage-ip'),
  ('CA110B', 'Live CA110B Single Pole MCB 6kA B Curve 10A', 'live-electrical-10a-single-pole-b-curve-mcb-2', '◆ Rated current In(A): 6,10,16,20,25,32,40,50,63 ◆ Poles: 1P,2P,3P,4P ◆ Rated voltage Ue(AC): 230/400V ◆ Rated frequency: 50/60Hz ◆ Insulation voltage Ui: 500V ◆ Rated breaking capacity(A): 6/10kA ◆ Rated impulse withstand voltage(1.2/50) Uimp(V): 4000 ◆ Dielectric test voltage at ind. Frq for 1 min(KV): 2 ◆ Thermo-magnetic release characteristic: B,C,D ◆ Electrical life: 8,000 ◆ Mechanical life: 20,000 ◆ Contact position degree: IP20 ◆ Reference temperature for setting of thermal element( ℃ ): 30 ◆ Ambient temperature (with daily average ≤ 35 ℃ : -5~+40 ) ◆ Storage temperature( ℃ ): -25~+70', 'Live Electrical', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/CA110B.png', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
