als","Screw Terminal Type":"Cage Terminal","Connecting Capacity":"Busbar 10 mm² Rigid 35 …35 mm² Flexible 25 …25 mm²","Tightening Torque":"Top 1.2 N·m Bottom 2.8 N·m","Mounting Type":"on DIN rail EN 60715 (35 mm) by means of fast clip device in consumer unit Type A according to IEC 61439-1&3, BS EN 61439-1&3, in distribution board Type B according to IEC 61439-1&3, BS EN 61439-1&3.","Power Supply Connection":"Bottom","Position of Neutral Terminals":"Right","Power Loss":"5.5 W","Accessory Type":"Auxiliary contact Signal contact / auxiliary contact Shunt trip Undervoltage release Overvoltage release Auxiliary contact for MCBs bottom fitting"}'::jsonb, '/images/products/DSE201MC16AC30.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-differentiels-rcbo'),
