  ('S203MD63', 'ABB 2CDS273001R0631 S203MD63 MCB TP 63A', 'abb-2cds273001r0631-s203md63-mcb-tp-63a', 'ABB is a leader in power and automation technologies that enable utility and industry customers to improve their performance while lowering environmental impact. ABB aims to connect people through technology and are striving towards a more productive, sustainable future. The ABB 2CDS273001R0631 S203MD63 is a triple pole, 63A MCB with 10kA breaking capacity and ‘D’ tripping characteristic. Suitable for residential, commercial and industrial applications, this current limiting MCB offers a delayed thermal tripping mechanism for overload protection and an electromechanic tripping mechanism for short circuit protection.', 'ABB Ltd', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/ABBtriplePole.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
  ('S203MB50', 'ABB 2CDS273001R0505 S203MB50 MCB TP 10KA', 'abb-2cds273001r0505-s203mb50-mcb-tp-10ka', 'ABB is a leader in power and automation technologies that enable utility and industry customers to improve their performance while lowering environmental impact. ABB aims to connect people through technology and are striving towards a more productive, sustainable future. The ABB 2CDS273001R0505 S203MB50 is a triple pole, 50A MCB with 10kA breaking capacity and ‘B’ tripping characteristic. Suitable for residential, commercial and industrial applications, the MCB offers protection and control of circuits against overloads and short-circuits, as well as protection for people and large lengths of cables in TN and IT systems.', 'ABB Ltd', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/ABBtriplePole.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
