  ('S203MB40', 'ABB 2CDS273001R0405 S203MB40 MCB TP 10KA', 'abb-2cds273001r0405-s203mb40-mcb-tp-10ka', 'ABB is a leader in power and automation technologies that enable utility and industry customers to improve their performance while lowering environmental impact. ABB aims to connect people through technology and are striving towards a more productive, sustainable future. The ABB 2CDS273001R0405 S203MB40 is a triple pole, 40A MCB with 10kA breaking capacity and ‘B’ tripping characteristic. Suitable for residential, commercial and industrial applications, the MCB offers protection and control of circuits against overloads and short-circuits, as well as protection for people and large lengths of cables in TN and IT systems. The MCB is also suitable for flow-type heaters – 21, 24 and 27kW.', 'ABB Ltd', '{}'::jsonb, '/images/products/ABBtriplePole.jpg', 'disjoncteurs-mcb'),
